{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01D9BweuwUrAoihKgpz57tnd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed imagined/predicted experimental results for all \"planned\" experiments in the experiment plan, assuming a \"median\" tier outcome. I need to provide specific metrics, rationales, and analysis for each experiment, all within the median tier definitions provided.\n\nLet me go through each planned experiment and generate predictions consistent with the median tier.\n\nLet me recall the median tier key metrics:\n- probe_fulldata_macro_f1: [0.78, 0.85]\n- gap_vs_repeat3_fulldata_pp: [2.0, 5.0]\n\n\n- gap_vs_lf_oracle_pp: [1.0, 3.0]\n- cross_agent_macro_f1: [0.68, 0.78]\n- human_gold_probe_f1: [0.72, 0.82]\n- human_label_accuracy_pct: [70, 80]\n- meanpool_lr_macro_f1: [0.75, 0.82]\n- llm_judge_f1: [0.8, 0.88]\n- llm_judge_cost_multiplier: [15, 80]\n\nNow I'm looking at the planned experiments and need to generate median-tier predictions for probe-002. Looking at the median tier results, I need to estimate how the full data training performs. The confidence threshold noise causes roughly a 5-10 percentage point F1 drop, so if the MVP achieved 0.9055 on conf≥2, the full data version should land around 0.82. This narrows the gap with the Repeat-3 baseline to just 2-5 points, though I should verify how Repeat-3 itself performs on the full dataset since it was originally 0.8432 on the filtered test set. The key benchmark I'm tracking is the probe_fulldata_macro_f1 range of 0.78 to 0.85.\n\nFor the other baselines, the LF oracle sits only 1-3 points above the probe on full data, making it a marginal improvement. The LLM judge approach achieves around 0.84 F1 but at roughly 30x the computational cost. Meanwhile, the meanpool-lr baseline trails at approximately 0.78 F1.\n\nComparing against human annotation, the probe performs substantially better—around 0.82 on full data versus 0.77 for human-annotated gold labels, which themselves only achieve 75% accuracy. Now I'm thinking through the probe-002 experiment specifically: training on the full 54,809 windows including the noisier conf=1 examples should degrade performance compared to the filtered dataset, since the model will be learning from more label noise.\n\nFor the baseline-lf-oracle, I need to clarify what's happening—if the test labels themselves come from LF majority vote, then using the LF outputs directly as predictions would theoretically achieve near-perfect accuracy on the conf≥2 subset by definition. The real test is how it performs on the full dataset and human-annotated data where the LF agreement breaks down. the oracle should achieve near-perfect accuracy on the test set since both the oracle and test labels derive from the same majority-vote LFs. The meaningful comparison emerges on human-annotated data, where the probe's 1-3pp advantage over the LF oracle likely comes from learning patterns the LFs themselves can't capture. I'm realizing the LF oracle comparison needs to focus on human gold labels since the oracle achieves perfect accuracy on the auto-labeled test set by construction—both use majority vote. On human gold, the LF oracle gets around 0.74 while the probe reaches 0.77, giving roughly a 3 percentage point advantage that aligns with the narrative of a narrowing but still meaningful gap.\n\nNow I need to plan out the remaining experiments: the error analysis should qualitatively describe what patterns the probe captures that the baseline misses and where it still falls short, while the cross-agent evaluation shows a significant performance drop to around 0.73 macro F1 when transferring to OpenHands.\n\nFor the ablations, I'm testing window size variations where k=5 is optimal, comparing different architectures where the GRU with attention is currently best, removing individual labeling functions to identify which ones matter most, and examining the impact of the supervised contrastive learning component.\n\nOn data scaling, performance climbs steadily from around 0.78 at 10% of the data up to the current 0.9055 at full scale, showing clear improvement with more training examples. I'm also planning to evaluate a non-NLP baseline using only structural features to quantify how much the natural language embeddings contribute versus what structural patterns alone can achieve.\n\nFor the early termination experiment, I need to measure the token savings against the success rate tradeoff—how many tokens can we skip while accepting some degradation in performance. The interpretability analysis should reveal whether t-SNE embeddings show meaningful separation and whether attention patterns exhibit detectable changes when stagnation begins. Finally, I want to track which labeling functions activate first at the stagnation onset to understand the temporal dynamics.\n\nNow I'm setting up the YAML output and need to ensure all the numbers stay internally consistent within the median tier ranges, particularly keeping the full-data macro F1 around 0.82 and the gap versus repeat baseline within the 2.0-5.0 range.\n\nComputing the derived metrics for the probe—if full data achieves 0.82 and the repeat-3 baseline drops by 3.5 percentage points, that puts the baseline around 0.785.\n\nBut I need to reconsider: repeat-3 is a heuristic that doesn't depend on training data, so its performance on the full test set might differ from the confidence-filtered subset. The noisier windows at confidence level 1 could make the heuristic perform worse overall, even though it scored 0.8432 on the higher-confidence test set.\n\nNow looking at the LF oracle results—on the auto-labeled test set, the oracle would trivially achieve perfect performance since it's just reproducing the labels, while the probe gets 0.82. The meaningful comparison is on human gold labels, where the probe reaches 0.77 and the LF oracle gets 0.75, giving a 2 percentage point gap. With these numbers confirmed, I'm ready to write up the YAML and prepare the tables and figures.\n\nI'm reconsidering the Repeat-3 baseline across different test sets. Since it's a label-agnostic heuristic, its performance depends on how well it aligns with the ground truth. The full data test set includes confidence=1 windows where labels are noisier, so Repeat-3 would likely perform worse there (0.785) compared to the cleaner confidence≥2 subset (0.8432)—the noisier labels make agreement less likely.\n\nNow I'm looking at the performance gap between my probe and Repeat-3. On the confidence≥2 test set, the gap is 6.24 percentage points, but when moving to full data, both models drop—the probe to 0.82 and Repeat-3 to 0.785—shrinking the gap to 3.5 percentage points.\n\nI'm also planning ablation studies to validate my design choices. For window size, I'm testing k=3, k=5 (current), and k=7 to see how context length affects stagnation detection. For architecture, I'm comparing the current GRU with attention against alternatives like GRU with mean pooling, a Transformer encoder, and an MLP baseline.\n\nI'm also ablating each labeling function individually to measure their contribution—command_repetition appears to be the most informative, while outcome_backpropagation has the least impact. And I need to clarify whether the current probe uses SupCon or not, since that's a separate component I'm testing.\n\nLooking at the scaling behavior, performance climbs steadily from 0.80 at 10% of the data up to 0.9055 at full scale, suggesting the model benefits from more training examples. The non-NLP baseline shows that structural features alone get to around 0.72, meaning the natural language embeddings contribute roughly 18 percentage points of improvement. Now I'm examining the early termination simulation results.\n\nThe stagnation detection threshold trades off efficiency against accuracy—at a 0.7 probability threshold, we save 22% of tokens but lose 3% success rate, while pushing to 0.5 saves 35% tokens at the cost of 8% accuracy. The interpretability analysis reveals two main clusters in the embedding space with some overlap at the boundaries where misclassifications occur, and the attention mechanism consistently focuses on positions 3-4 where stagnation typically begins. For the human annotation study, three annotators labeled 400 windows with substantial agreement (κ = 0.62), and when evaluated against the gold standard, the probe achieves 0.77 F1 while the LLM judge performs best at 0.82.\n\nLooking at the temporal dynamics of the labeling functions, command repetition fires earliest as a signal, followed by file diff changes, with outcome backpropagation arriving last since it depends on having the final result. Now I'm thinking through the LLM judge performance more carefully—zero-shot Claude gets around 0.81 F1, few-shot with examples bumps that to 0.84, but the cost is roughly 35 times higher than running the probe, and latency jumps from milliseconds to several seconds per window.\n\nI should note that confidence-aware training appears in the narrative guidance as a supplementary experiment but isn't formally listed in the main plan, so I'll incorporate it as part of the probe-002 analysis rather than treating it as standalone. Now I'm ready to write out the full YAML with detailed experiment specifications and the tables that would support each one.\n\nLet me think through the baseline-lf-oracle behavior more carefully on the standard test set. When confidence is high (≥2), multiple LFs agree, so the oracle's majority vote matches the label model's output perfectly. But on the full test set including confidence=1 cases, the oracle might diverge—where only a single LF voted, the oracle's prediction depends on that one LF's output while the label model may have made a different decision.\n\nActually, wait. If confidence=1 means only one LF voted non-abstain, then the oracle applying all the same LFs would get identical results. The oracle F1 on auto-labeled test data would be 1.0 by construction, since the oracle is just reapplying the same labeling functions that generated the labels. This makes the oracle baseline only meaningful when compared against other approaches, not as an absolute performance measure.\n\nThe real insight is comparing the oracle (0.75 F1 on human gold labels) against the probe (0.77 F1), showing the probe learns to generalize slightly beyond the LF patterns. That 2 percentage point gap is what matters—it demonstrates the probe captures something the labeling functions miss, even though the LFs themselves are only 75% accurate on human-annotated data. Now I'm settling on the F1 numbers: oracle at 0.75 and probe at 0.77, giving us that 2 percentage point gap. Time to structure the full YAML output with all the required fields—name, plan_id, description, expected results, rationale, tables, figures, and analysis sections.\n\nI'm organizing the three main components: confidence-aware training as part of probe-002 to recover full-data performance, error analysis to examine the repeat-3 patterns the probe missed, and the data scaling curve showing annotation efficiency. For the tables, I'll need to cover the main results comparing probe-002 against baselines, cross-agent transfer performance, ablations, human annotation metrics, and LLM judge comparisons. The figures will showcase the data scaling trajectory.\n\nWriting the YAML structure now...\n\nActually, I'm realizing the median narrative reframes the contribution—it's less about the probe being superior and more about positioning weak supervision as the core innovation. This shifts how I present each experiment's significance. For cross-agent transfer specifically, I'm looking at zero-shot performance dropping from 0.9055 on SWE-agent down to 0.73 on OpenHands trajectories, which is a meaningful 17-point gap that needs careful framing in the results.\n\nThe few-shot fine-tuning progression shows recovery potential though—moving from 0.73 zero-shot up through 0.78, 0.82, and finally 0.85 with 500 examples—which demonstrates the learned representations transfer well with minimal adaptation. I'll include this as supplementary evidence that domain adaptation is feasible.\n\nNow I'm also examining the LLM-as-judge baseline more carefully, comparing zero-shot performance across Claude and GPT-4o, both hovering around 0.80-0.81 F1.\n\nAdding few-shot examples pushes both models slightly higher—Claude to 0.84 and GPT-4o to 0.83—but the cost difference is striking. The probe runs at roughly $0.0005 per window with sub-5ms latency, while Claude costs $0.02-0.05 and takes around 3 seconds, making it about 35x more expensive and 600x slower. For the median tier specifically, the probe achieves 0.82 on full data while the few-shot LLM judge reaches 0.84, so there's a real performance advantage to the judge despite the cost penalty—that's the key tradeoff to highlight in the paper.\n\nBut when I look at higher-confidence data (conf≥2), the probe jumps to 0.9055 versus the LLM judge's 0.84, flipping the narrative entirely. On human gold labels, though, the LLM judge pulls ahead at 0.82 compared to the probe's 0.77, which actually undermines the probe story since the advantage becomes purely economic rather than performance-based. The framing needs to emphasize that the framework achieves comparable or better results at a fraction of the cost, especially when controlling for label quality, but I'm realizing the gold label results complicate that claim.\n\nLet me reconsider what these numbers actually represent. The LLM judge evaluates windows directly without relying on auto-labels, so I can measure its performance against either dataset. Looking at the breakdown: the LLM judge hits 0.84 on auto-labels (fitting the [0.8, 0.88] range) and likely around 0.82 on gold labels, while the probe shows 0.9055 on high-confidence auto-labels but drops to 0.77 on gold labels. The full probe performance sits at 0.82 on auto-labels, which matches the LLM judge's performance there.\n\nThe key insight is that on auto-labels the probe wins, but on gold labels the LLM judge pulls ahead—that's the tension I'm seeing in the median tier. The real story here is that weak supervision lets me train a cost-effective probe that stays competitive with the LLM judge despite having access to far less context, all while being 35x cheaper. Now I'm ready to structure this into YAML and also work through the error analysis findings—the probe tends to flag exploration as false positives while missing semantic stagnation, though it does catch repetition patterns the LLM judge misses. I need to structure the YAML carefully with detailed predictions for each of the 16 planned experiments, making sure the tables and figures arrays contain string descriptions rather than trying to format actual tables. Let me work through the full experiment list systematically, paying special attention to the result rationale and analysis sections where I can highlight the qualitative contributions, especially for the median-tier experiments where error analysis becomes more important than raw quantitative gains.\n\nFor the early-termination simulation specifically, I'm modeling a scenario where we apply the stagnation probe to held-out trajectories and measure both the token savings we'd achieve by terminating early and the cost in terms of tasks that would have eventually succeeded. At a conservative threshold of 0.7 probability of stagnation, we'd expect to save around 18-25% of tokens while only incorrectly terminating 2-4% of tasks—a reasonable tradeoff. At a more aggressive 0.5 threshold, we'd push toward 30-40% token savings but risk 6-10% of tasks failing prematurely. The key insight here is that we can't truly know counterfactually whether a terminated trajectory would have recovered, so there's an inherent uncertainty in measuring the success rate impact.\n\nFor interpretability, the t-SNE visualization of the GRU hidden states reveals two distinct clusters corresponding to progress and stagnation, with a transition zone between them, and the stagnation cluster itself breaks down into sub-clusters reflecting different failure modes like repetitive loops, semantic confusion, and exploratory dead-ends. The attention patterns are revealing too—during stagnation windows, the model focuses heavily on the later steps in the window (around steps 3-5), whereas progress windows show more distributed attention across the sequence. This temporal focus pattern suggests the probe is genuinely learning to recognize the dynamics of how stagnation emerges.\n\nLooking at the lead times for different signals, command repetition tends to fire about 1.5 steps before stagnation becomes apparent, file differences show up almost immediately at 0.5 steps, and outcome backpropagation lags by about 2 steps, meaning it's a reactive signal that confirms stagnation is already underway.\n\nThe key insight is that command repetition acts as the earliest warning sign while outcome backpropagation serves as retrospective confirmation, and the attention mechanism aligns with this—it weights most heavily the steps where command repetition fires. Now I'm ready to write out the full YAML results. One detail I want to nail is the confidence-weighted training experiment from probe-002, where I'm weighting the loss based on confidence scores—high confidence windows get full weight, medium confidence gets reduced weight, and low confidence gets minimal weight. The results show this approach yields a modest 2 percentage point improvement in F1 over standard training, though it still falls short of the performance on higher-confidence examples.\n\nNow I'm compiling the cost-accuracy tradeoff across different approaches: the probe achieves solid F1 scores at minimal cost per window, the LLM-based methods are more expensive but offer comparable or slightly better accuracy, the labeling function oracle provides perfect accuracy at negligible cost, and the simple repetition baseline is free but less reliable. The probe emerges as the most cost-effective option on the Pareto frontier.\n\nThe framing for this work emphasizes how weak supervision enables scalable progress monitoring with practical deployment flexibility—the probe becomes the go-to choice when LLM inference budgets are tight. Now I'm ready to structure all these results into the final output format.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10641,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10641},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ea9dc2cd-3d17-4be6-9bd9-cd17a4f97e5b","uuid":"83329248-9a8e-4f32-8e08-907131b04d2d"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01D9BweuwUrAoihKgpz57tnd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Median档叙事核心转向：弱监督框架（Claim 1）升格为主贡献，probe从\"性能大幅领先\"降级为\"在噪声标签下仍具竞争力的下游验证\"。\n  全量数据F1下降至0.82（-8.5pp），gap vs Repeat-3收窄至3.5pp，需要error analysis和定性证据补强。\n  跨agent迁移存在但需domain adaptation（zero-shot F1=0.73，few-shot可恢复至0.82+）。\n  LLM judge在gold标签上反超probe（0.82 vs 0.77），probe优势锚定在cost-efficiency（35x cheaper）。\n  Paper叙事从\"probe很强\"转向\"弱监督框架使这类研究成为可能，probe是框架的一个高效下游应用\"。\n  Claim 2从\"显著优于\"降级为\"在噪声标签下仍具竞争优势+捕获Repeat-3遗漏的语义停滞模式\"。\n  Claim 3从\"保持有效\"调整为\"zero-shot迁移可行但需few-shot adaptation\"。\n  补充confidence-aware training和data scaling曲线展示框架的实用性和数据效率。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"全量数据训练（conf≥1）\"\n    plan_id: \"probe-002\"\n    description: \"在全部54,809窗口（含39,408个conf=1噪声窗口）上训练GRU probe，对比conf≥2基线\"\n    expected_results:\n      fulldata_test_macro_f1: 0.82\n      fulldata_test_accuracy: 0.865\n      fulldata_test_f1_stagnation: 0.76\n      fulldata_test_f1_progress: 0.88\n      fulldata_repeat3_f1: 0.785\n      gap_vs_repeat3_fulldata_pp: 3.5\n      conf_ge2_only_macro_f1: 0.9055  # 已知baseline\n      drop_from_conf2_pp: 8.5\n      confidence_weighted_macro_f1: 0.84\n      confidence_weighted_gain_pp: 2.0\n      best_epoch_fulldata: 5\n      training_windows: 54809\n      val_macro_f1_best_fulldata: 0.85\n    result_rationale: >\n      conf=1窗口占全量数据72%（39,408/54,809），这些窗口仅有单个LF投票，标签噪声率估计25-35%。\n      噪声主要影响stagnation类（少数类），因为conf=1中大量实际progress窗口被单个保守LF误标为stagnation，\n      导致stagnation F1从0.8593暴跌至0.76（-10pp），而progress F1仅从0.9518降至0.88（-7pp）。\n      整体macro-F1下降8.5pp至0.82，符合median档[0.78,0.85]区间中部。\n      Repeat-3在全量测试集上也受影响——conf=1窗口中许多语义停滞不涉及命令重复，Repeat-3从0.8432降至0.785。\n      Gap从6.24pp缩小至3.5pp，probe仍优于Repeat-3但优势不再compelling。\n      Confidence-weighted training（loss按conf加权：conf3=1.0, conf2=0.7, conf1=0.3）部分恢复至0.84，\n      说明显式建模标签可信度有帮助但无法完全补偿噪声——因为conf=1窗口的标签本身就有系统性偏差而非随机噪声。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Full-data vs High-confidence Training | Setting | Macro-F1 | Stag-F1 | Prog-F1 | Gap vs R3 | conf≥2 only: 0.9055, 0.8593, 0.9518, +6.24pp | Full (conf≥1): 0.82, 0.76, 0.88, +3.5pp | Conf-weighted: 0.84, 0.79, 0.89, +4.5pp\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart对比三个训练设置（conf≥2, full, conf-weighted）在macro-F1和per-class F1上的表现，附带Repeat-3水平虚线作为参考\"\n      - \"Confusion matrix对比：conf≥2训练 vs full训练，展示stagnation类FN显著增加\"\n    analysis: >\n      全量数据训练的F1下降证实了conf=1标签噪声是核心瓶颈。关键发现：(1) 噪声不对称——stagnation类受损更严重，\n      因为conf=1中存在大量\"假stagnation\"标签（单个保守LF的误判）；(2) confidence-weighted training恢复2pp，\n      说明框架的confidence信号有实际价值；(3) probe在全量数据上仍优于Repeat-3（+3.5pp），但优势收窄意味着\n      Claim 2需从\"显著优于\"降级为\"在噪声条件下仍具竞争优势\"。\n      Paper叙事调整：强调conf≥2子集（15,401窗口）作为\"高质量核心数据集\"的价值，全量数据实验作为robustness test。\n      Confidence-aware training作为方法论贡献——展示弱监督框架的confidence校准可直接用于下游训练。\n\n  - name: \"LF Ensemble Oracle Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-lf-oracle\"\n    description: \"直接用LF实时输出做窗口级判定，在auto-labeled和human-gold两个评估集上与probe对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      oracle_auto_test_macro_f1: 1.00\n      oracle_auto_test_accuracy: 1.00\n      oracle_gold_macro_f1: 0.75\n      oracle_gold_accuracy: 0.75\n      oracle_gold_f1_stagnation: 0.70\n      oracle_gold_f1_progress: 0.80\n      probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.77\n      gap_probe_vs_oracle_gold_pp: 2.0\n      oracle_conf1_subset_gold_accuracy: 0.62\n      oracle_conf2_subset_gold_accuracy: 0.83\n    result_rationale: >\n      LF oracle在auto-labeled测试集上达到1.0 F1——这是定义层面的结果，因为测试标签本身就是LF majority vote。\n      这意味着probe在auto-labels上永远无法\"超越\"oracle（0.9055 < 1.0），probe的增量价值只能在human gold上体现。\n      在400窗口human gold上，oracle F1=0.75：三个LF的majority vote是对progress/stagnation的合理但不完美近似，\n      conf=1子集尤其薄弱（accuracy仅62%），因为单LF投票缺乏交叉验证。\n      Probe在gold上达0.77（+2pp），说明probe通过embedding空间学到了LF未显式编码的模式——\n      特别是语义相似但表面不同的stagnation模式（paraphrased repetition）。\n      但2pp的gap仅边际显著（400样本下bootstrap CI可能overlap），这是median档的核心张力：\n      probe的增量价值真实存在但统计上不够robust。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: LF Oracle vs Probe on Auto-Labels and Gold Labels | Evaluation Set | LF Oracle F1 | Probe F1 | Gap | Auto-labeled (conf≥2 test): 1.00, 0.9055, -9.45pp | Auto-labeled (full test): 1.00, 0.82, -18pp | Human Gold (all): 0.75, 0.77, +2.0pp | Human Gold (conf=1 subset): 0.60, 0.68, +8pp | Human Gold (conf≥2 subset): 0.84, 0.83, -1pp\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Venn diagram展示LF oracle和probe各自正确/错误的窗口集合，highlight probe独有正确案例（oracle错probe对）的语义特征\"\n    analysis: >\n      Oracle baseline揭示了弱监督框架的核心limitation：在auto-labels上，probe无法超越label source本身。\n      Probe的价值在于泛化——在human gold上+2pp，特别是在conf=1子集上+8pp（0.68 vs 0.60），\n      说明probe在LF disagree的模糊区域学到了更好的decision boundary。\n      但conf≥2 gold子集上oracle反超probe 1pp（0.84 vs 0.83），说明当LFs一致且正确时probe没有增量价值。\n      Paper framing：oracle baseline不是probe的竞争对手而是框架的一部分——oracle提供quick-and-dirty判断，\n      probe提供更robust的泛化，两者是同一框架的不同deployment选项。\n\n  - name: \"LLM-as-Judge Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-llm-judge\"\n    description: \"Claude-3.5-Sonnet和GPT-4o作为zero-shot和few-shot judge，在auto-labels和gold上评估\"\n    expected_results:\n      claude_zeroshot_auto_macro_f1: 0.81\n      claude_fewshot_auto_macro_f1: 0.84\n      gpt4o_zeroshot_auto_macro_f1: 0.80\n      gpt4o_fewshot_auto_macro_f1: 0.83\n      claude_fewshot_gold_macro_f1: 0.82\n      gpt4o_fewshot_gold_macro_f1: 0.80\n      probe_conf2_auto_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      probe_fulldata_auto_macro_f1: 0.82\n      probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.77\n      cost_per_window_probe_usd: 0.0005\n      cost_per_window_claude_usd: 0.018\n      cost_multiplier: 35\n      latency_probe_ms: 3\n      latency_claude_ms: 2800\n      latency_multiplier: 930\n      total_eval_windows: 500\n      api_cost_total_usd: 95\n    result_rationale: >\n      LLM judge有access to full window context（raw trajectory text），而probe只看embedding。\n      Claude few-shot在auto-labels上达0.84——接近conf≥2 probe（0.9055）但低于oracle（1.0）。\n      关键发现：在human gold上，Claude few-shot达0.82，反超probe的0.77——LLM的语义理解能力使其在gold evaluation上更强。\n      这是median档的核心挑战：LLM judge在质量上占优，probe的优势只剩cost-efficiency。\n      Cost multiplier=35x：每个窗口5步×200-400 tokens/步=1000-2000 input tokens + prompt template，\n      Claude-3.5-Sonnet pricing下约$0.018/窗口，vs probe的embedding inference $0.0005/窗口。\n      Latency差距更大：probe <5ms（GPU inference）vs LLM ~2.8s（API roundtrip + generation）。\n      Zero-shot vs few-shot gap约3pp，说明LLM需要task-specific calibration但门槛不高。\n      GPT-4o略弱于Claude 1-2pp，两者差距不大。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: LLM-as-Judge vs Probe | Method | Auto F1 | Gold F1 | $/window | ms/window | Probe (conf≥2): 0.9055, 0.77, 0.0005, 3 | Probe (full): 0.82, 0.77, 0.0005, 3 | Claude ZS: 0.81, 0.79, 0.018, 2800 | Claude FS: 0.84, 0.82, 0.018, 2800 | GPT-4o ZS: 0.80, 0.78, 0.015, 3200 | GPT-4o FS: 0.83, 0.80, 0.015, 3200 | LF Oracle: 1.00, 0.75, ~0, ~0\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cost-Accuracy Pareto图：x轴=$/window (log scale)，y轴=Gold F1，每个method一个点，Pareto front连线。Probe和LF oracle在左下（cheap+decent），LLM judge在右上（expensive+best）\"\n      - \"Latency-F1 散点图：展示probe在real-time deployment场景的优势（<5ms inference enables per-step monitoring）\"\n    analysis: >\n      LLM judge在gold F1上超过probe 5pp（0.82 vs 0.77），这是median档最具挑战性的结果——reviewer可能问\"为什么不直接用LLM\"。\n      应对策略：(1) Cost-accuracy Pareto展示probe在budget-constrained场景的价值——监控54K窗口用LLM需$972 vs probe $27；\n      (2) Latency argument——probe的3ms inference使per-step real-time monitoring成为可能，LLM的2.8s不适合在线干预；\n      (3) 架构论证——probe是轻量local model，可在edge/on-device部署，不依赖API availability。\n      Paper应诚实承认LLM judge的quality优势，将probe定位为\"practical deployment option\"而非\"quality frontier\"。\n      框架贡献的重心不受影响——弱监督标注框架解决的是数据获取问题，下游可以用probe也可以用LLM judge做inference。\n\n  - name: \"Mean-Pooling + Logistic Regression Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-meanpool-lr\"\n    description: \"窗口内step embeddings做mean-pooling后接LR分类器，作为参数匹配下界验证GRU时序建模增量\"\n    expected_results:\n      meanpool_lr_conf2_macro_f1: 0.86\n      meanpool_lr_conf2_accuracy: 0.89\n      meanpool_lr_conf2_f1_stagnation: 0.81\n      meanpool_lr_conf2_f1_progress: 0.91\n      meanpool_lr_fulldata_macro_f1: 0.79\n      gap_gru_vs_meanpool_conf2_pp: 4.5\n      gap_gru_vs_meanpool_fulldata_pp: 3.0\n      meanpool_lr_gold_macro_f1: 0.74\n    result_rationale: >\n      Mean-pooling丢弃了步骤间的顺序信息——将5个step embeddings均匀平均为单个向量。\n      在conf≥2上达0.86（vs GRU 0.9055, gap=4.5pp），说明embedding空间本身已编码了相当的progress/stagnation信号，\n      即使没有时序建模也能达到reasonable性能。4.5pp的gap虽然真实，但不像6.24pp（GRU vs Repeat-3）那么compelling。\n      在全量数据上gap缩小至3pp（0.82 vs 0.79），因为标签噪声同时削弱两个方法，但GRU更受时序信号disruption影响。\n      Stagnation F1（0.81）显著低于GRU（0.8593），符合直觉——stagnation的onset位置是关键时序信号，mean-pooling无法捕获。\n      Median档核心问题：\"GRU与LR差距存在但不大（2-4pp），时序建模claim需补充attention可视化等定性证据\"。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Temporal Modeling Ablation | Method | conf≥2 F1 | Full F1 | Gold F1 | Stag F1 (conf≥2) | GRU+Attn: 0.9055, 0.82, 0.77, 0.8593 | MeanPool+LR: 0.86, 0.79, 0.74, 0.81 | Repeat-3: 0.8432, 0.785, 0.72, 0.75 | Gap GRU-LR: +4.5pp, +3pp, +3pp, +5pp\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired error analysis：GRU正确但LR错误的窗口 vs LR正确但GRU错误的窗口——按stagnation onset位置分组，展示GRU在early-onset和late-onset stagnation上的优势\"\n    analysis: >\n      4.5pp gap支持时序建模有增量价值，但在median档下这不足以standalone支撑Claim 2。\n      需要补充定性证据：(1) attention可视化展示GRU在stagnation onset位置的注意力集中模式（LR无法表达）；\n      (2) 错误分析展示GRU独有正确案例集中在\"渐进式停滞\"（前2步正常、后3步停滞）——这类模式mean-pooling会被前2步稀释。\n      Paper建议将GRU vs LR差距frame为\"时序建模在stagnation onset检测上的边际贡献\"，而非\"GRU大幅优于静态方法\"。\n\n  - name: \"Probe Error Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"error-analysis\"\n    description: \"Probe FP/FN按action type、LF source、trajectory outcome分类，揭示probe捕获vs遗漏的模式\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_errors_conf2_test: 221\n      false_positives: 98\n      false_negatives: 123\n      fp_rate: 0.063\n      fn_rate: 0.079\n      fp_dominant_category: \"exploration_misclassified_as_stagnation\"\n      fp_exploration_pct: 42\n      fp_single_lf_disagreement_pct: 31\n      fp_trajectory_eventually_succeeded_pct: 67\n      fn_dominant_category: \"semantic_stagnation_without_repetition\"\n      fn_no_repeat3_signal_pct: 71\n      fn_diverse_commands_pct: 58\n      fn_trajectory_failed_pct: 89\n      probe_catches_repeat3_misses: 187\n      repeat3_catches_probe_misses: 34\n      overlap_correct: 2571\n    result_rationale: >\n      在conf≥2测试集（~3,080窗口）上，probe有221个错误（7.18% error rate）。\n      FP（98个）：最大类别是\"exploration误判为stagnation\"（42%）——agent在搜索文件、尝试不同路径，\n      每步都不同但整体缺乏linear progress，probe将这种\"发散性探索\"误读为停滞。31%的FP在LF层面就有分歧（conf=2但两个LF方向相反）。\n      FN（123个）：主导类别是\"无重复的语义停滞\"（58%）——agent执行多样化命令但都不朝goal方向推进，\n      71%的FN在Repeat-3层面也miss（因为没有字面重复）。这是probe当前的盲区：需要goal-awareness才能检测的停滞。\n      Probe独有正确187个 vs Repeat-3独有正确34个：probe的主要增量来自检测paraphrased repetition（同一操作不同表述）\n      和gradual stagnation（前几步有进展、后几步停滞的窗口）。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Error Taxonomy | Category | Count | % of Errors | Example Pattern | FP-exploration: 41, 42%, agent grep/find不同文件 | FP-lf-conflict: 30, 31%, conf=2但LF方向冲突 | FP-other: 27, 27%, edge cases | FN-semantic-stag: 72, 58%, 多样命令零进展 | FN-late-onset: 31, 25%, 停滞在窗口最后1-2步 | FN-other: 20, 16%, rare patterns\"\n      - \"Table: Probe vs Repeat-3 Error Overlap | | R3 Correct | R3 Wrong | Probe Correct: 2571, 187 | Probe Wrong: 34, 221-overlap矩阵\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Sankey diagram：错误类型 → action type → trajectory outcome，展示错误流向\"\n      - \"具体案例展示（3-4个典型FP/FN），每个案例包含5步window原文摘要 + LF输出 + probe预测 + gold label\"\n    analysis: >\n      Error analysis是median档的关键定性贡献。两个核心发现：\n      (1) Probe捕获了187个Repeat-3遗漏的窗口，集中在paraphrased repetition和gradual onset——这些是heuristic无法表达的模式，\n      支撑\"学习的时序模型捕获了启发式之外的信号\"这一降级后的claim。\n      (2) Probe的主要盲区是goal-unaware semantic stagnation——agent做不同的事但都没用，检测这类停滞需要task-level goal理解。\n      这为future work提供了明确方向（goal-conditioned probe）。\n      Paper中这部分应重点展示具体案例（case study），用qualitative evidence弥补quantitative gap收窄带来的说服力不足。\n\n  - name: \"跨Agent迁移评估（OpenHands）\"\n    plan_id: \"cross-agent\"\n    description: \"SWE-agent训练的probe在OpenHands轨迹上zero-shot评估 + few-shot fine-tuning恢复曲线\"\n    expected_results:\n      openhands_total_trajectories: 2140\n      openhands_total_windows: 18720\n      openhands_lf_adapted_coverage: 0.87\n      zeroshot_macro_f1: 0.73\n      zeroshot_accuracy: 0.78\n      zeroshot_f1_stagnation: 0.65\n      zeroshot_f1_progress: 0.81\n      drop_from_swe_agent_pp: 17.5\n      zeroshot_vs_random_pp: 23.0\n      zeroshot_vs_majority_pp: 30.7\n      zeroshot_repeat3_openhands_f1: 0.71\n      gap_vs_repeat3_openhands_pp: 2.0\n      fewshot_50_macro_f1: 0.78\n      fewshot_200_macro_f1: 0.82\n      fewshot_500_macro_f1: 0.85\n      openhands_embedding_time_hours: 3.2\n      openhands_lf_adaptation_issues: \"command format差异导致command_repetition LF recall下降15%\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Zero-shot迁移F1=0.73（-17.5pp from SWE-agent的0.9055），符合median档[0.68,0.78]区间。\n      下降来源：(1) OpenHands和SWE-agent的action space差异——OpenHands用不同的命令格式和文件操作API，\n      导致embedding空间分布shift；(2) LF适配不完全——command_repetition LF依赖特定命令格式匹配，\n      OpenHands格式差异导致recall下降15%，file_diff_delta LF较robust（基于git diff，与agent无关）；\n      (3) 轨迹结构差异——OpenHands倾向更短的action序列和更频繁的tool switching。\n      Stagnation F1（0.65）远低于progress F1（0.81），说明stagnation模式的跨agent迁移更困难——\n      不同agent的\"停滞方式\"差异大于\"进展方式\"。\n      Few-shot fine-tuning效果显著：50个标注窗口即恢复至0.78，200个恢复至0.82，500个接近SWE-agent性能（0.85）。\n      这支持\"learned representations are transferable starting points\"的叙事。\n      Repeat-3在OpenHands上也下降至0.71（SWE-agent上0.8432），probe保持2pp领先。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Cross-Agent Transfer | Setting | Macro-F1 | Stag-F1 | Prog-F1 | SWE-agent (conf≥2): 0.9055, 0.8593, 0.9518 | OpenHands zero-shot: 0.73, 0.65, 0.81 | OpenHands 50-shot: 0.78, 0.72, 0.84 | OpenHands 200-shot: 0.82, 0.77, 0.87 | OpenHands 500-shot: 0.85, 0.81, 0.89\"\n      - \"Table: Baselines on OpenHands | Method | Macro-F1 | Random: 0.50 | Majority: 0.42 | Repeat-3: 0.71 | Cosine-sim: 0.35 | Probe zero-shot: 0.73 | Probe 200-shot: 0.82\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Few-shot learning curve：x轴=fine-tuning样本数（0,50,200,500），y轴=macro-F1，含SWE-agent performance水平虚线\"\n      - \"t-SNE对比：SWE-agent GRU hidden states vs OpenHands GRU hidden states，展示distribution shift但保持cluster结构\"\n    analysis: >\n      Zero-shot F1=0.73证实了跨agent progress信号的可迁移性——probe学到的不仅是SWE-agent特定行为模式。\n      但17.5pp drop也说明domain adaptation是必要的，不能claim\"直接迁移保持有效\"。\n      Few-shot曲线是median档的关键补充实验——200个窗口即可恢复至0.82，说明probe representations\n      提供了strong initialization，远优于from-scratch训练（相同200样本from-scratch仅~0.65）。\n      Claim 3调整为：\"zero-shot迁移存在（+23pp vs random），few-shot adaptation高效（200样本恢复至82%），\n      表明probe学到的progress信号具有跨实现的通用性，但需要少量target-domain数据calibration\"。\n      LF适配问题应在Limitations中明确讨论——command_repetition的format dependency是框架的结构性弱点。\n\n  - name: \"Window Size消融\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-window-size\"\n    description: \"k=3,5,7步窗口大小消融，评估检测粒度与信号积累的tradeoff\"\n    expected_results:\n      k3_macro_f1: 0.86\n      k3_f1_stagnation: 0.81\n      k3_total_windows: 22130\n      k5_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      k5_f1_stagnation: 0.8593\n      k5_total_windows: 15401\n      k7_macro_f1: 0.89\n      k7_f1_stagnation: 0.84\n      k7_total_windows: 11280\n      optimal_k: 5\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=3（0.86）：窗口太短，stagnation信号不够accumulate——3步中可能只有1-2步显示停滞迹象，\n      导致stagnation F1从0.8593降至0.81。同时窗口数量增加（22K vs 15K），但每个窗口的信噪比降低。\n      k=5（0.9055）：最优平衡点——足够长以捕获stagnation onset的时序签名，又不至于被过多context稀释。\n      k=7（0.89）：窗口过长引入两个问题——(1) 跨phase窗口增多（前4步progress+后3步stagnation混合），\n      标签变得ambiguous；(2) 可用训练窗口减少（11K，短轨迹被排除）。\n      k=5 > k=7的1.5pp gap不大，但一致支持5步作为default选择。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Window Size Ablation | k | Windows | Macro-F1 | Stag-F1 | Prog-F1 | 3: 22130, 0.86, 0.81, 0.91 | 5: 15401, 0.9055, 0.8593, 0.9518 | 7: 11280, 0.89, 0.84, 0.94\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line chart: k vs macro-F1和per-class F1，展示k=5的sweet spot\"\n    analysis: >\n      k=5是clear optimal，但k=3和k=7的性能下降不剧烈（<5pp），说明probe对窗口大小较robust。\n      Paper中作为Table放在appendix，主文一句话提及\"k=5 optimal, robust to ±2 steps\"。\n\n  - name: \"架构消融\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-architecture\"\n    description: \"GRU+attention vs GRU+mean-pool vs Transformer encoder vs MLP on concat，在conf≥2上对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      gru_attention_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      gru_meanpool_macro_f1: 0.89\n      transformer_encoder_macro_f1: 0.90\n      mlp_concat_macro_f1: 0.87\n      gru_attention_params: 542000\n      gru_meanpool_params: 530000\n      transformer_encoder_params: 1200000\n      mlp_concat_params: 2600000\n    result_rationale: >\n      GRU+attention（0.9055）vs Transformer（0.90）：差距仅0.5pp，Transformer理论上有更强的长程依赖建模，\n      但5步窗口太短，长程优势无法发挥，反而参数量是GRU的2.2x，更容易在小数据上overfit。\n      GRU+mean-pool（0.89）vs GRU+attention（0.9055）：attention贡献1.5pp，主要来自对stagnation onset位置的加权——\n      attention机制允许模型关注窗口内的关键转折点，mean-pool则均匀对待每步。\n      MLP on concat（0.87）：将5个1024维embedding拼接为5120维向量后接MLP，完全丢弃顺序信息，\n      性能最低但仍远超Repeat-3（+2.7pp），说明embedding空间本身的区分度很高。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Architecture Ablation | Architecture | Macro-F1 | Stag-F1 | Params | Inference ms | GRU+Attn: 0.9055, 0.8593, 542K, 2.8 | GRU+MeanPool: 0.89, 0.84, 530K, 2.5 | Transformer: 0.90, 0.85, 1.2M, 3.5 | MLP-Concat: 0.87, 0.82, 2.6M, 1.2\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Params vs F1 散点图，展示GRU+attention的efficiency优势（最少参数、最高F1）\"\n    analysis: >\n      架构选择对性能的影响（3.5pp range）小于训练数据质量的影响（8.5pp drop on full data）。\n      这支持paper的framing——\"架构是deliberate simple technical choice，不是核心贡献\"。\n      GRU+attention的marginal优势（vs Transformer +0.5pp）在统计上可能不显著，\n      但parameter efficiency（542K vs 1.2M）和inference speed是合理的选择理由。\n      放在appendix，主文用一句话：\"GRU+attention achieves best F1 among four architectures (0.87-0.91 range); architecture choice matters less than label quality.\"\n\n  - name: \"LF Hold-One-Out消融\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-lf-holdout\"\n    description: \"每次移除一个LF重新生成标签并训练probe，量化各LF边际贡献\"\n    expected_results:\n      all_3_lfs_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      without_command_repetition_f1: 0.87\n      without_command_repetition_drop_pp: 3.5\n      without_file_diff_delta_f1: 0.88\n      without_file_diff_delta_drop_pp: 2.5\n      without_outcome_backprop_f1: 0.89\n      without_outcome_backprop_drop_pp: 1.5\n      without_command_repetition_conf2_windows: 9800\n      without_file_diff_delta_conf2_windows: 10200\n      without_outcome_backprop_conf2_windows: 12100\n      without_command_repetition_label_flip_pct: 12.3\n      without_file_diff_delta_label_flip_pct: 8.7\n      without_outcome_backprop_label_flip_pct: 5.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      command_repetition移除后drop最大（-3.5pp）：这是最informative的LF，因为命令重复是stagnation最直接的信号，\n      移除它后12.3%的窗口标签翻转，conf≥2窗口数从15,401降至9,800（大量窗口失去第二个支持LF），\n      训练数据大幅缩减导致probe性能下降。\n      file_diff_delta移除（-2.5pp）：文件改动信号是progress的strong indicator，移除后probe更难区分\n      \"有file diff的progress\"和\"无diff的exploration\"。\n      outcome_backpropagation移除（-1.5pp）：结果回传LF是lagging indicator（需要trajectory结束后才能计算），\n      对实时检测的边际贡献最小。但它提供了唯一的outcome-level信号，移除后probe对\"最终成功前的暂时停滞\"更容易FP。\n      三个LF都有不可替代的贡献（最小drop仍有1.5pp），支持\"三个LF互补\"的框架设计claim。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: LF Hold-One-Out | Removed LF | Macro-F1 | Drop | conf≥2 Windows | Label Flips % | None: 0.9055, -, 15401, - | command_rep: 0.87, -3.5pp, 9800, 12.3% | file_diff: 0.88, -2.5pp, 10200, 8.7% | outcome_bp: 0.89, -1.5pp, 12100, 5.1%\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar chart展示每个LF被移除后的label flip方向（progress→stagnation vs stagnation→progress）\"\n    analysis: >\n      LF hold-out支持框架设计的合理性：每个LF贡献1.5-3.5pp，没有冗余LF。\n      command_repetition是backbone LF，但移除后probe仍达0.87（远超Repeat-3），说明probe不仅学了repetition检测。\n      Paper中作为Table 3放主文（支撑Claim 1），强调LF互补性是data programming在trajectory上有效的关键。\n\n  - name: \"SupCon辅助损失消融\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-supcon\"\n    description: \"对比有/无supervised contrastive loss对F1和embedding分离度的影响\"\n    expected_results:\n      without_supcon_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      with_supcon_macro_f1: 0.915\n      supcon_gain_pp: 1.0\n      without_supcon_silhouette_score: 0.42\n      with_supcon_silhouette_score: 0.58\n      supcon_weight_optimal: 0.3\n      with_supcon_fulldata_macro_f1: 0.835\n      supcon_fulldata_gain_pp: 1.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      当前probe（probe-001）未使用SupCon。添加SupCon辅助损失（权重0.3）在conf≥2上仅提升1pp至0.915——\n      因为conf≥2数据本身已经很clean，embedding空间的CE loss已足够分离两类。\n      但SupCon的真正价值在全量数据上：+1.5pp（0.835 vs 0.82），因为contrastive loss对noisy labels更robust——\n      即使部分样本label错误，大多数同类样本仍会pull together，提供了implicit label smoothing效果。\n      Silhouette score从0.42提升至0.58，说明SupCon确实改善了embedding空间的类别分离度。\n      但整体增益modest（1-1.5pp），在median档下不值得作为独立贡献，放appendix。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: SupCon Ablation | Setting | w/o SupCon | w/ SupCon | Gain | conf≥2 F1: 0.9055, 0.915, +1.0pp | Full F1: 0.82, 0.835, +1.5pp | Silhouette: 0.42, 0.58, +0.16\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"t-SNE visualization对比：无SupCon vs 有SupCon的GRU hidden states，展示类别分离度改善\"\n    analysis: >\n      SupCon提供modest improvement，在全量数据上更有价值（+1.5pp）。\n      建议作为\"confidence-aware training\"的supplement之一——combined with conf-weighted loss，\n      可能将full-data F1推至0.84-0.85。但不改变median档的整体叙事。Appendix material。\n\n  - name: \"Non-NLP Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"non-nlp-baseline\"\n    description: \"仅用纯结构/数值特征分类（行数改动、命令类型、文件数等），证明NL embedding的必要性\"\n    expected_results:\n      structural_features_only_f1: 0.72\n      structural_features_accuracy: 0.78\n      structural_f1_stagnation: 0.63\n      structural_f1_progress: 0.81\n      features_used: 15\n      feature_importance_top3: \"lines_changed_std, unique_commands_ratio, file_count_delta\"\n      gap_vs_probe_pp: 18.5\n      gap_vs_repeat3_pp: -12.3\n      structural_plus_embedding_f1: 0.91\n    result_rationale: >\n      纯结构特征（15个手工特征：行数改动均值/方差、唯一命令比例、文件数变化、命令长度、AST相关指标等）\n      在GBM分类器上达0.72——远超random（0.50）但远低于embedding-based方法（0.9055）。\n      关键gap在stagnation检测（0.63 vs 0.8593）：结构特征无法区分\"表面不同但语义相似的停滞\"——\n      两个不同命令的行数改动可能相似，但语义上一个是有效修复、另一个是无效尝试。\n      NL embedding的增量价值=18.5pp，这是venue fit论证的核心数据——证明NL理解（而非纯SE指标）\n      对progress estimation是必要的，使paper属于NLP scope而非SE-only。\n      Structural+embedding融合（0.91）略优于纯embedding（0.9055），说明结构特征提供少量complementary信号。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: NLP vs Non-NLP Features | Feature Set | Macro-F1 | Stag-F1 | Structural only (15 features): 0.72, 0.63 | NL Embedding only (GRU): 0.9055, 0.8593 | Structural + Embedding: 0.91, 0.87 | Gap (embed-structural): +18.5pp, +23pp\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Feature importance bar chart（结构特征top-10），展示哪些SE指标对progress最有信息量\"\n      - \"Scatter plot：structural feature prediction confidence vs embedding prediction confidence，展示两者disagreement区域\"\n    analysis: >\n      18.5pp gap是venue fit论证的killer evidence——纯结构特征不够，NL understanding是必要的。\n      这将paper锚定在NLP scope：progress estimation不是一个可以用SE metrics解决的问题，需要语义层面的建模。\n      Structural+embedding的marginal gain（+0.5pp）说明feature engineering不是bottleneck。\n      主文Table，用于Section 5的venue fit论证段落。\n\n  - name: \"Data Scaling曲线\"\n    plan_id: \"data-scaling\"\n    description: \"10%/25%/50%/100%训练数据→probe F1，评估标注数据需求和框架效率\"\n    expected_results:\n      scale_10pct_windows: 1540\n      scale_10pct_macro_f1: 0.80\n      scale_25pct_windows: 3850\n      scale_25pct_macro_f1: 0.85\n      scale_50pct_windows: 7700\n      scale_50pct_macro_f1: 0.88\n      scale_100pct_windows: 15401\n      scale_100pct_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      diminishing_returns_threshold: \"50%（~7.7K windows）\"\n      scale_10pct_vs_repeat3_gap_pp: -4.3\n      scale_25pct_vs_repeat3_gap_pp: 0.7\n      scale_50pct_vs_repeat3_gap_pp: 3.7\n    result_rationale: >\n      10%数据（1,540窗口）probe达0.80——低于Repeat-3（0.8432），说明极少数据下heuristic更reliable。\n      25%（3,850窗口）达0.85，首次surpass Repeat-3（+0.7pp），标志着\"probe优于heuristic\"的数据门槛。\n      50%（7,700窗口）达0.88，性能曲线开始flatten——50%→100%仅+2.5pp vs 25%→50%的+3pp。\n      Scaling近似log-linear：每翻倍数据约+2-3pp，符合typical neural model behavior。\n      关键takeaway：框架生成的15K高质量窗口已接近saturation，继续扩大数据量（如纳入conf=1）\n      回报递减且引入噪声——这从数据效率角度论证了\"conf≥2策略的合理性\"。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Data Scaling | Training % | Windows | Macro-F1 | vs Repeat-3 | 10%: 1540, 0.80, -4.3pp | 25%: 3850, 0.85, +0.7pp | 50%: 7700, 0.88, +3.7pp | 100%: 15401, 0.9055, +6.2pp\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Learning curve: x轴=训练窗口数(log scale)，y轴=macro-F1，含Repeat-3水平虚线和25% crossover标注\"\n    analysis: >\n      Data scaling曲线是弱监督框架的效率论证——用LFs自动生成的15K标签足以训练competitive probe。\n      对比人工标注成本：标注15K窗口按$0.5/窗口需$7,500+annotator管理开销，\n      而LF开发是one-time effort（3个LF + majority vote pipeline）。\n      25%crossover point（~4K窗口）是practical guidance——部署时minimum viable dataset约4K窗口。\n      放主文Figure，支撑Claim 1（弱监督框架有效性+数据效率）。\n\n  - name: \"Early Termination模拟\"\n    plan_id: \"early-termination-sim\"\n    description: \"在held-out轨迹上模拟probe-triggered early termination，计算token savings vs success rate tradeoff\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_held_out_trajectories: 320\n      threshold_07_token_savings_pct: 22\n      threshold_07_success_rate_drop_pct: 3.1\n      threshold_05_token_savings_pct: 35\n      threshold_05_success_rate_drop_pct: 7.8\n      threshold_09_token_savings_pct: 12\n      threshold_09_success_rate_drop_pct: 1.2\n      intervention_paradox_cases: 28\n      intervention_paradox_pct: 8.7\n      avg_tokens_saved_per_trajectory: 4200\n      optimal_threshold: 0.7\n      pareto_auc: 0.82\n    result_rationale: >\n      在320条held-out轨迹上模拟：当probe连续N个窗口输出P(stagnation)>threshold时触发early termination。\n      Threshold=0.7（推荐设置）：节省22% tokens（平均每条轨迹省4,200 tokens），success rate仅下降3.1%。\n      下降来自Intervention Paradox：28条轨迹（8.7%）被probe正确识别为\"当前停滞\"后终止，\n      但实际上agent在后续步骤中\"突破\"了停滞并最终解决问题——这是fundamentally不可避免的。\n      Threshold=0.5（激进）：35% token savings但7.8% success rate drop，部分premature termination。\n      Threshold=0.9（保守）：仅12% savings但近零false termination。\n      Median档下这些数据是decent但不spectacular——22% savings不足以支撑standalone的\"cost reduction\"claim，\n      作为supplementary result放附录。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Early Termination Tradeoff | Threshold | Token Savings % | Success Drop % | False Terminations | 0.5: 35%, -7.8%, 25 | 0.7: 22%, -3.1%, 10 | 0.9: 12%, -1.2%, 4\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Pareto curve: x轴=success rate drop，y轴=token savings %，每个threshold一个点，含annotated optimal point\"\n      - \"Case study: 2-3个Intervention Paradox案例——probe正确检测stagnation但agent后来recovered\"\n    analysis: >\n      Early termination实验展示probe的practical deployment价值，但median档下savings不够impressive（22%）。\n      Intervention Paradox（8.7%）是honest limitation——任何real-time monitor都面临这个问题。\n      Paper建议放Discussion section作为\"deployment考量\"，不作为core result。\n      重点highlight Intervention Paradox作为methodological insight——offline probe evaluation和online intervention之间的gap。\n\n  - name: \"可解释性分析（t-SNE + Attention）\"\n    plan_id: \"interpretability\"\n    description: \"GRU hidden states的t-SNE/UMAP可视化 + attention weight在stagnation onset位置的分析\"\n    expected_results:\n      tsne_cluster_separation: \"partial\"\n      tsne_silhouette_score: 0.42\n      tsne_boundary_overlap_pct: 18\n      attention_stagnation_peak_position: \"step 3-4 (late window)\"\n      attention_progress_distribution: \"relatively uniform\"\n      attention_entropy_stagnation: 1.2\n      attention_entropy_progress: 1.8\n      attention_onset_alignment_with_lf_pct: 68\n    result_rationale: >\n      t-SNE展示两个主cluster（progress和stagnation）但存在18%的boundary overlap——\n      这些overlap窗口主要是conf=2中两个LF分歧较大的borderline cases和exploration-that-looks-like-stagnation。\n      Silhouette score 0.42（moderate）反映了问题本身的ambiguity，不是模型缺陷。\n      Attention分析揭示关键模式：stagnation窗口中attention集中在step 3-4（窗口后段），\n      这与stagnation onset的直觉一致——前几步可能还在progress，后几步才开始stagnation。\n      Progress窗口的attention更均匀（entropy 1.8 vs stagnation的1.2），因为每步都有contribution。\n      Attention peak与LF firing位置对齐68%——probe的attention\"看到了\"和LF相似但不完全相同的位置。\n      剩余32%的misalignment是probe学到的LF之外的信号。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"t-SNE 2D scatter plot：progress（蓝）vs stagnation（红），transparency=confidence level，标注overlap region\"\n      - \"Attention heatmap grid：5个典型stagnation窗口和5个progress窗口的attention weight分布，x轴=step position\"\n      - \"Attention entropy histogram：stagnation窗口（左偏，集中attention）vs progress窗口（右偏，分散attention）\"\n    analysis: >\n      可解释性分析是median档下支撑Claim 2（时序建模价值）的关键定性证据。\n      Attention模式提供了GRU vs mean-pool差距（4.5pp）的直观解释：mean-pool等权对待5步，\n      但stagnation detection需要关注\"从哪步开始停滞\"——attention机制正好捕获了这个onset位置信号。\n      t-SNE figure放主文（Figure 3），attention heatmap放主文（Figure 4）。\n      这些可视化弥补了quantitative gap收窄后的说服力需求。\n\n  - name: \"人工标注Gold Set\"\n    plan_id: \"human-annotation\"\n    description: \"400窗口×3标注者人工标注，Fleiss κ，在gold标签上重评所有方法\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_windows_annotated: 400\n      annotators: 3\n      fleiss_kappa: 0.62\n      inter_annotator_agreement_pct: 78\n      majority_vote_label_accuracy_on_gold: 75\n      conf1_label_accuracy_on_gold: 62\n      conf2_label_accuracy_on_gold: 83\n      conf3_label_accuracy_on_gold: 94\n      probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.77\n      probe_gold_f1_stagnation: 0.71\n      probe_gold_f1_progress: 0.83\n      repeat3_gold_macro_f1: 0.72\n      lf_oracle_gold_macro_f1: 0.75\n      meanpool_lr_gold_macro_f1: 0.74\n      llm_judge_gold_macro_f1: 0.82\n      cosine_sim_gold_macro_f1: 0.38\n      gold_progress_pct: 62\n      gold_stagnation_pct: 38\n      gold_vs_auto_label_disagreement_pct: 25\n    result_rationale: >\n      Fleiss κ=0.62（substantial agreement）反映任务的inherent ambiguity——\"progress\"和\"stagnation\"的边界在人类判断中也不清晰，\n      特别是exploration、backtracking、partial progress等灰色地带。\n      Majority vote标签准确率75%（整体），conf分层明显：conf3=94%（几乎完美）、conf2=83%（可靠）、conf1=62%（接近随机）。\n      这直接验证了conf作为质量proxy的有效性，也解释了全量数据F1下降——38%的conf=1标签是错的。\n      Probe在gold上达0.77——低于auto-labeled conf≥2上的0.9055（-13pp），因为：\n      (1) probe在auto-labels上训练，对auto-labels overfitting；(2) human gold发现了一些LFs系统性遗漏的模式\n      （如\"有效exploration被LF标为stagnation\"）。\n      LLM judge在gold上达0.82（超过probe 5pp），因为LLM直接理解语义，不受LF bias的间接影响。\n      关键：probe在gold上仍优于LF oracle（+2pp）和Repeat-3（+5pp），confirm了learning的增量价值。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: All Methods on Human Gold Set (N=400) | Method | Gold Macro-F1 | Gold Stag-F1 | Gold Prog-F1 | LLM Judge (FS): 0.82, 0.78, 0.86 | Probe (conf≥2): 0.77, 0.71, 0.83 | LF Oracle: 0.75, 0.70, 0.80 | MeanPool+LR: 0.74, 0.68, 0.80 | Repeat-3: 0.72, 0.65, 0.79 | Cosine-sim: 0.38, 0.30, 0.46 | Random: 0.50, 0.48, 0.52\"\n      - \"Table: Label Quality by Confidence | Confidence | Windows | Auto-Gold Agreement | Accuracy | conf=1: 160, 62%, 62% | conf=2: 200, 83%, 83% | conf=3: 40, 94%, 94% | Overall: 400, 75%, 75%\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart：所有方法在gold F1上的对比，从高到低排列\"\n      - \"Calibration plot：confidence level vs label accuracy，展示conf的quality proxy有效性\"\n    analysis: >\n      Human gold evaluation是median档的核心实验——它打破circular evaluation，提供\"ground truth\"参考。\n      关键发现：(1) probe在gold上仍是best non-LLM method（0.77），验证了学习的增量价值；\n      (2) LLM judge在gold上领先（0.82），但cost 35x——probe是cost-constrained场景的最佳选择；\n      (3) conf=1标签质量差（62%）是全量数据F1下降的root cause，明确了框架的改进方向（更好的LF或label model）；\n      (4) κ=0.62说明任务本身hard，0.77的gold F1实际上已经接近人类水平。\n      Paper主文Table（最重要的result table之一），Section 5.3 \"Evaluation on Human Gold Labels\"。\n\n  - name: \"LF Temporal Dynamics\"\n    plan_id: \"lf-temporal-dynamics\"\n    description: \"分析各LF在stagnation onset前后的firing时序——leading vs lagging indicator\"\n    expected_results:\n      command_repetition_median_lead_steps: 1.5\n      command_repetition_first_fire_pct: 58\n      file_diff_delta_median_lead_steps: 0.5\n      file_diff_delta_first_fire_pct: 28\n      outcome_backprop_median_lag_steps: 2.0\n      outcome_backprop_first_fire_pct: 14\n      lf_agreement_at_onset: 0.35\n      lf_agreement_deep_stagnation: 0.72\n      probe_attention_aligns_with_leading_lf_pct: 65\n    result_rationale: >\n      command_repetition是最早的leading indicator（median lead 1.5步）：命令重复往往在stagnation初期就出现，\n      agent开始\"重试\"之前的操作。58%的stagnation窗口中它最先firing。\n      file_diff_delta接近同步（lead 0.5步）：文件改动减少与stagnation几乎同时发生，因为停滞的直接表现就是代码不再变化。\n      outcome_backpropagation是lagging indicator（lag 2步）：需要知道轨迹最终结果才能回传，\n      在real-time场景中这个信号不可用——但对offline analysis有价值。\n      Onset时刻LF agreement仅0.35——stagnation初期信号微弱，各LF判断不一致；\n      深度停滞阶段agreement升至0.72——所有信号converge。\n      这解释了conf=1窗口的噪声来源：很多conf=1窗口是stagnation onset的early stage，\n      只有一个leading LF发出信号，其他LF尚未fire。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: LF Temporal Characteristics | LF | Median Lead/Lag | First-Fire % | Type | command_rep: +1.5 steps, 58%, leading | file_diff: +0.5 steps, 28%, synchronous | outcome_bp: -2.0 steps, 14%, lagging\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Timeline plot：以stagnation onset为零点，展示三个LF的firing概率随时间变化的曲线\"\n      - \"Heatmap：LF agreement × window position，展示onset处的低agreement到深度停滞处的高agreement\"\n    analysis: >\n      LF temporal dynamics提供了框架的mechanistic insight——不同LF在stagnation lifecycle中扮演不同角色。\n      对实际部署有指导意义：real-time monitoring应更权重command_repetition（leading），offline analysis可用outcome_backprop（lagging）。\n      对conf=1噪声的解释很有价值——onset阶段的低agreement是structural而非random noise，\n      这为confidence-aware training的改进方向提供了理论依据（时序权重而非静态confidence权重）。\n      放Discussion section或Appendix作为框架的deeper analysis。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10641,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10641},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ea9dc2cd-3d17-4be6-9bd9-cd17a4f97e5b","uuid":"50dfee00-fcc3-4df1-9db5-d4d161a0029b"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":502482,"duration_api_ms":503748,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Median档叙事核心转向：弱监督框架（Claim 1）升格为主贡献，probe从\"性能大幅领先\"降级为\"在噪声标签下仍具竞争力的下游验证\"。\n  全量数据F1下降至0.82（-8.5pp），gap vs Repeat-3收窄至3.5pp，需要error analysis和定性证据补强。\n  跨agent迁移存在但需domain adaptation（zero-shot F1=0.73，few-shot可恢复至0.82+）。\n  LLM judge在gold标签上反超probe（0.82 vs 0.77），probe优势锚定在cost-efficiency（35x cheaper）。\n  Paper叙事从\"probe很强\"转向\"弱监督框架使这类研究成为可能，probe是框架的一个高效下游应用\"。\n  Claim 2从\"显著优于\"降级为\"在噪声标签下仍具竞争优势+捕获Repeat-3遗漏的语义停滞模式\"。\n  Claim 3从\"保持有效\"调整为\"zero-shot迁移可行但需few-shot adaptation\"。\n  补充confidence-aware training和data scaling曲线展示框架的实用性和数据效率。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"全量数据训练（conf≥1）\"\n    plan_id: \"probe-002\"\n    description: \"在全部54,809窗口（含39,408个conf=1噪声窗口）上训练GRU probe，对比conf≥2基线\"\n    expected_results:\n      fulldata_test_macro_f1: 0.82\n      fulldata_test_accuracy: 0.865\n      fulldata_test_f1_stagnation: 0.76\n      fulldata_test_f1_progress: 0.88\n      fulldata_repeat3_f1: 0.785\n      gap_vs_repeat3_fulldata_pp: 3.5\n      conf_ge2_only_macro_f1: 0.9055  # 已知baseline\n      drop_from_conf2_pp: 8.5\n      confidence_weighted_macro_f1: 0.84\n      confidence_weighted_gain_pp: 2.0\n      best_epoch_fulldata: 5\n      training_windows: 54809\n      val_macro_f1_best_fulldata: 0.85\n    result_rationale: >\n      conf=1窗口占全量数据72%（39,408/54,809），这些窗口仅有单个LF投票，标签噪声率估计25-35%。\n      噪声主要影响stagnation类（少数类），因为conf=1中大量实际progress窗口被单个保守LF误标为stagnation，\n      导致stagnation F1从0.8593暴跌至0.76（-10pp），而progress F1仅从0.9518降至0.88（-7pp）。\n      整体macro-F1下降8.5pp至0.82，符合median档[0.78,0.85]区间中部。\n      Repeat-3在全量测试集上也受影响——conf=1窗口中许多语义停滞不涉及命令重复，Repeat-3从0.8432降至0.785。\n      Gap从6.24pp缩小至3.5pp，probe仍优于Repeat-3但优势不再compelling。\n      Confidence-weighted training（loss按conf加权：conf3=1.0, conf2=0.7, conf1=0.3）部分恢复至0.84，\n      说明显式建模标签可信度有帮助但无法完全补偿噪声——因为conf=1窗口的标签本身就有系统性偏差而非随机噪声。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Full-data vs High-confidence Training | Setting | Macro-F1 | Stag-F1 | Prog-F1 | Gap vs R3 | conf≥2 only: 0.9055, 0.8593, 0.9518, +6.24pp | Full (conf≥1): 0.82, 0.76, 0.88, +3.5pp | Conf-weighted: 0.84, 0.79, 0.89, +4.5pp\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart对比三个训练设置（conf≥2, full, conf-weighted）在macro-F1和per-class F1上的表现，附带Repeat-3水平虚线作为参考\"\n      - \"Confusion matrix对比：conf≥2训练 vs full训练，展示stagnation类FN显著增加\"\n    analysis: >\n      全量数据训练的F1下降证实了conf=1标签噪声是核心瓶颈。关键发现：(1) 噪声不对称——stagnation类受损更严重，\n      因为conf=1中存在大量\"假stagnation\"标签（单个保守LF的误判）；(2) confidence-weighted training恢复2pp，\n      说明框架的confidence信号有实际价值；(3) probe在全量数据上仍优于Repeat-3（+3.5pp），但优势收窄意味着\n      Claim 2需从\"显著优于\"降级为\"在噪声条件下仍具竞争优势\"。\n      Paper叙事调整：强调conf≥2子集（15,401窗口）作为\"高质量核心数据集\"的价值，全量数据实验作为robustness test。\n      Confidence-aware training作为方法论贡献——展示弱监督框架的confidence校准可直接用于下游训练。\n\n  - name: \"LF Ensemble Oracle Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-lf-oracle\"\n    description: \"直接用LF实时输出做窗口级判定，在auto-labeled和human-gold两个评估集上与probe对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      oracle_auto_test_macro_f1: 1.00\n      oracle_auto_test_accuracy: 1.00\n      oracle_gold_macro_f1: 0.75\n      oracle_gold_accuracy: 0.75\n      oracle_gold_f1_stagnation: 0.70\n      oracle_gold_f1_progress: 0.80\n      probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.77\n      gap_probe_vs_oracle_gold_pp: 2.0\n      oracle_conf1_subset_gold_accuracy: 0.62\n      oracle_conf2_subset_gold_accuracy: 0.83\n    result_rationale: >\n      LF oracle在auto-labeled测试集上达到1.0 F1——这是定义层面的结果，因为测试标签本身就是LF majority vote。\n      这意味着probe在auto-labels上永远无法\"超越\"oracle（0.9055 < 1.0），probe的增量价值只能在human gold上体现。\n      在400窗口human gold上，oracle F1=0.75：三个LF的majority vote是对progress/stagnation的合理但不完美近似，\n      conf=1子集尤其薄弱（accuracy仅62%），因为单LF投票缺乏交叉验证。\n      Probe在gold上达0.77（+2pp），说明probe通过embedding空间学到了LF未显式编码的模式——\n      特别是语义相似但表面不同的stagnation模式（paraphrased repetition）。\n      但2pp的gap仅边际显著（400样本下bootstrap CI可能overlap），这是median档的核心张力：\n      probe的增量价值真实存在但统计上不够robust。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: LF Oracle vs Probe on Auto-Labels and Gold Labels | Evaluation Set | LF Oracle F1 | Probe F1 | Gap | Auto-labeled (conf≥2 test): 1.00, 0.9055, -9.45pp | Auto-labeled (full test): 1.00, 0.82, -18pp | Human Gold (all): 0.75, 0.77, +2.0pp | Human Gold (conf=1 subset): 0.60, 0.68, +8pp | Human Gold (conf≥2 subset): 0.84, 0.83, -1pp\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Venn diagram展示LF oracle和probe各自正确/错误的窗口集合，highlight probe独有正确案例（oracle错probe对）的语义特征\"\n    analysis: >\n      Oracle baseline揭示了弱监督框架的核心limitation：在auto-labels上，probe无法超越label source本身。\n      Probe的价值在于泛化——在human gold上+2pp，特别是在conf=1子集上+8pp（0.68 vs 0.60），\n      说明probe在LF disagree的模糊区域学到了更好的decision boundary。\n      但conf≥2 gold子集上oracle反超probe 1pp（0.84 vs 0.83），说明当LFs一致且正确时probe没有增量价值。\n      Paper framing：oracle baseline不是probe的竞争对手而是框架的一部分——oracle提供quick-and-dirty判断，\n      probe提供更robust的泛化，两者是同一框架的不同deployment选项。\n\n  - name: \"LLM-as-Judge Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-llm-judge\"\n    description: \"Claude-3.5-Sonnet和GPT-4o作为zero-shot和few-shot judge，在auto-labels和gold上评估\"\n    expected_results:\n      claude_zeroshot_auto_macro_f1: 0.81\n      claude_fewshot_auto_macro_f1: 0.84\n      gpt4o_zeroshot_auto_macro_f1: 0.80\n      gpt4o_fewshot_auto_macro_f1: 0.83\n      claude_fewshot_gold_macro_f1: 0.82\n      gpt4o_fewshot_gold_macro_f1: 0.80\n      probe_conf2_auto_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      probe_fulldata_auto_macro_f1: 0.82\n      probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.77\n      cost_per_window_probe_usd: 0.0005\n      cost_per_window_claude_usd: 0.018\n      cost_multiplier: 35\n      latency_probe_ms: 3\n      latency_claude_ms: 2800\n      latency_multiplier: 930\n      total_eval_windows: 500\n      api_cost_total_usd: 95\n    result_rationale: >\n      LLM judge有access to full window context（raw trajectory text），而probe只看embedding。\n      Claude few-shot在auto-labels上达0.84——接近conf≥2 probe（0.9055）但低于oracle（1.0）。\n      关键发现：在human gold上，Claude few-shot达0.82，反超probe的0.77——LLM的语义理解能力使其在gold evaluation上更强。\n      这是median档的核心挑战：LLM judge在质量上占优，probe的优势只剩cost-efficiency。\n      Cost multiplier=35x：每个窗口5步×200-400 tokens/步=1000-2000 input tokens + prompt template，\n      Claude-3.5-Sonnet pricing下约$0.018/窗口，vs probe的embedding inference $0.0005/窗口。\n      Latency差距更大：probe <5ms（GPU inference）vs LLM ~2.8s（API roundtrip + generation）。\n      Zero-shot vs few-shot gap约3pp，说明LLM需要task-specific calibration但门槛不高。\n      GPT-4o略弱于Claude 1-2pp，两者差距不大。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: LLM-as-Judge vs Probe | Method | Auto F1 | Gold F1 | $/window | ms/window | Probe (conf≥2): 0.9055, 0.77, 0.0005, 3 | Probe (full): 0.82, 0.77, 0.0005, 3 | Claude ZS: 0.81, 0.79, 0.018, 2800 | Claude FS: 0.84, 0.82, 0.018, 2800 | GPT-4o ZS: 0.80, 0.78, 0.015, 3200 | GPT-4o FS: 0.83, 0.80, 0.015, 3200 | LF Oracle: 1.00, 0.75, ~0, ~0\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cost-Accuracy Pareto图：x轴=$/window (log scale)，y轴=Gold F1，每个method一个点，Pareto front连线。Probe和LF oracle在左下（cheap+decent），LLM judge在右上（expensive+best）\"\n      - \"Latency-F1 散点图：展示probe在real-time deployment场景的优势（<5ms inference enables per-step monitoring）\"\n    analysis: >\n      LLM judge在gold F1上超过probe 5pp（0.82 vs 0.77），这是median档最具挑战性的结果——reviewer可能问\"为什么不直接用LLM\"。\n      应对策略：(1) Cost-accuracy Pareto展示probe在budget-constrained场景的价值——监控54K窗口用LLM需$972 vs probe $27；\n      (2) Latency argument——probe的3ms inference使per-step real-time monitoring成为可能，LLM的2.8s不适合在线干预；\n      (3) 架构论证——probe是轻量local model，可在edge/on-device部署，不依赖API availability。\n      Paper应诚实承认LLM judge的quality优势，将probe定位为\"practical deployment option\"而非\"quality frontier\"。\n      框架贡献的重心不受影响——弱监督标注框架解决的是数据获取问题，下游可以用probe也可以用LLM judge做inference。\n\n  - name: \"Mean-Pooling + Logistic Regression Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-meanpool-lr\"\n    description: \"窗口内step embeddings做mean-pooling后接LR分类器，作为参数匹配下界验证GRU时序建模增量\"\n    expected_results:\n      meanpool_lr_conf2_macro_f1: 0.86\n      meanpool_lr_conf2_accuracy: 0.89\n      meanpool_lr_conf2_f1_stagnation: 0.81\n      meanpool_lr_conf2_f1_progress: 0.91\n      meanpool_lr_fulldata_macro_f1: 0.79\n      gap_gru_vs_meanpool_conf2_pp: 4.5\n      gap_gru_vs_meanpool_fulldata_pp: 3.0\n      meanpool_lr_gold_macro_f1: 0.74\n    result_rationale: >\n      Mean-pooling丢弃了步骤间的顺序信息——将5个step embeddings均匀平均为单个向量。\n      在conf≥2上达0.86（vs GRU 0.9055, gap=4.5pp），说明embedding空间本身已编码了相当的progress/stagnation信号，\n      即使没有时序建模也能达到reasonable性能。4.5pp的gap虽然真实，但不像6.24pp（GRU vs Repeat-3）那么compelling。\n      在全量数据上gap缩小至3pp（0.82 vs 0.79），因为标签噪声同时削弱两个方法，但GRU更受时序信号disruption影响。\n      Stagnation F1（0.81）显著低于GRU（0.8593），符合直觉——stagnation的onset位置是关键时序信号，mean-pooling无法捕获。\n      Median档核心问题：\"GRU与LR差距存在但不大（2-4pp），时序建模claim需补充attention可视化等定性证据\"。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Temporal Modeling Ablation | Method | conf≥2 F1 | Full F1 | Gold F1 | Stag F1 (conf≥2) | GRU+Attn: 0.9055, 0.82, 0.77, 0.8593 | MeanPool+LR: 0.86, 0.79, 0.74, 0.81 | Repeat-3: 0.8432, 0.785, 0.72, 0.75 | Gap GRU-LR: +4.5pp, +3pp, +3pp, +5pp\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired error analysis：GRU正确但LR错误的窗口 vs LR正确但GRU错误的窗口——按stagnation onset位置分组，展示GRU在early-onset和late-onset stagnation上的优势\"\n    analysis: >\n      4.5pp gap支持时序建模有增量价值，但在median档下这不足以standalone支撑Claim 2。\n      需要补充定性证据：(1) attention可视化展示GRU在stagnation onset位置的注意力集中模式（LR无法表达）；\n      (2) 错误分析展示GRU独有正确案例集中在\"渐进式停滞\"（前2步正常、后3步停滞）——这类模式mean-pooling会被前2步稀释。\n      Paper建议将GRU vs LR差距frame为\"时序建模在stagnation onset检测上的边际贡献\"，而非\"GRU大幅优于静态方法\"。\n\n  - name: \"Probe Error Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"error-analysis\"\n    description: \"Probe FP/FN按action type、LF source、trajectory outcome分类，揭示probe捕获vs遗漏的模式\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_errors_conf2_test: 221\n      false_positives: 98\n      false_negatives: 123\n      fp_rate: 0.063\n      fn_rate: 0.079\n      fp_dominant_category: \"exploration_misclassified_as_stagnation\"\n      fp_exploration_pct: 42\n      fp_single_lf_disagreement_pct: 31\n      fp_trajectory_eventually_succeeded_pct: 67\n      fn_dominant_category: \"semantic_stagnation_without_repetition\"\n      fn_no_repeat3_signal_pct: 71\n      fn_diverse_commands_pct: 58\n      fn_trajectory_failed_pct: 89\n      probe_catches_repeat3_misses: 187\n      repeat3_catches_probe_misses: 34\n      overlap_correct: 2571\n    result_rationale: >\n      在conf≥2测试集（~3,080窗口）上，probe有221个错误（7.18% error rate）。\n      FP（98个）：最大类别是\"exploration误判为stagnation\"（42%）——agent在搜索文件、尝试不同路径，\n      每步都不同但整体缺乏linear progress，probe将这种\"发散性探索\"误读为停滞。31%的FP在LF层面就有分歧（conf=2但两个LF方向相反）。\n      FN（123个）：主导类别是\"无重复的语义停滞\"（58%）——agent执行多样化命令但都不朝goal方向推进，\n      71%的FN在Repeat-3层面也miss（因为没有字面重复）。这是probe当前的盲区：需要goal-awareness才能检测的停滞。\n      Probe独有正确187个 vs Repeat-3独有正确34个：probe的主要增量来自检测paraphrased repetition（同一操作不同表述）\n      和gradual stagnation（前几步有进展、后几步停滞的窗口）。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Error Taxonomy | Category | Count | % of Errors | Example Pattern | FP-exploration: 41, 42%, agent grep/find不同文件 | FP-lf-conflict: 30, 31%, conf=2但LF方向冲突 | FP-other: 27, 27%, edge cases | FN-semantic-stag: 72, 58%, 多样命令零进展 | FN-late-onset: 31, 25%, 停滞在窗口最后1-2步 | FN-other: 20, 16%, rare patterns\"\n      - \"Table: Probe vs Repeat-3 Error Overlap | | R3 Correct | R3 Wrong | Probe Correct: 2571, 187 | Probe Wrong: 34, 221-overlap矩阵\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Sankey diagram：错误类型 → action type → trajectory outcome，展示错误流向\"\n      - \"具体案例展示（3-4个典型FP/FN），每个案例包含5步window原文摘要 + LF输出 + probe预测 + gold label\"\n    analysis: >\n      Error analysis是median档的关键定性贡献。两个核心发现：\n      (1) Probe捕获了187个Repeat-3遗漏的窗口，集中在paraphrased repetition和gradual onset——这些是heuristic无法表达的模式，\n      支撑\"学习的时序模型捕获了启发式之外的信号\"这一降级后的claim。\n      (2) Probe的主要盲区是goal-unaware semantic stagnation——agent做不同的事但都没用，检测这类停滞需要task-level goal理解。\n      这为future work提供了明确方向（goal-conditioned probe）。\n      Paper中这部分应重点展示具体案例（case study），用qualitative evidence弥补quantitative gap收窄带来的说服力不足。\n\n  - name: \"跨Agent迁移评估（OpenHands）\"\n    plan_id: \"cross-agent\"\n    description: \"SWE-agent训练的probe在OpenHands轨迹上zero-shot评估 + few-shot fine-tuning恢复曲线\"\n    expected_results:\n      openhands_total_trajectories: 2140\n      openhands_total_windows: 18720\n      openhands_lf_adapted_coverage: 0.87\n      zeroshot_macro_f1: 0.73\n      zeroshot_accuracy: 0.78\n      zeroshot_f1_stagnation: 0.65\n      zeroshot_f1_progress: 0.81\n      drop_from_swe_agent_pp: 17.5\n      zeroshot_vs_random_pp: 23.0\n      zeroshot_vs_majority_pp: 30.7\n      zeroshot_repeat3_openhands_f1: 0.71\n      gap_vs_repeat3_openhands_pp: 2.0\n      fewshot_50_macro_f1: 0.78\n      fewshot_200_macro_f1: 0.82\n      fewshot_500_macro_f1: 0.85\n      openhands_embedding_time_hours: 3.2\n      openhands_lf_adaptation_issues: \"command format差异导致command_repetition LF recall下降15%\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Zero-shot迁移F1=0.73（-17.5pp from SWE-agent的0.9055），符合median档[0.68,0.78]区间。\n      下降来源：(1) OpenHands和SWE-agent的action space差异——OpenHands用不同的命令格式和文件操作API，\n      导致embedding空间分布shift；(2) LF适配不完全——command_repetition LF依赖特定命令格式匹配，\n      OpenHands格式差异导致recall下降15%，file_diff_delta LF较robust（基于git diff，与agent无关）；\n      (3) 轨迹结构差异——OpenHands倾向更短的action序列和更频繁的tool switching。\n      Stagnation F1（0.65）远低于progress F1（0.81），说明stagnation模式的跨agent迁移更困难——\n      不同agent的\"停滞方式\"差异大于\"进展方式\"。\n      Few-shot fine-tuning效果显著：50个标注窗口即恢复至0.78，200个恢复至0.82，500个接近SWE-agent性能（0.85）。\n      这支持\"learned representations are transferable starting points\"的叙事。\n      Repeat-3在OpenHands上也下降至0.71（SWE-agent上0.8432），probe保持2pp领先。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Cross-Agent Transfer | Setting | Macro-F1 | Stag-F1 | Prog-F1 | SWE-agent (conf≥2): 0.9055, 0.8593, 0.9518 | OpenHands zero-shot: 0.73, 0.65, 0.81 | OpenHands 50-shot: 0.78, 0.72, 0.84 | OpenHands 200-shot: 0.82, 0.77, 0.87 | OpenHands 500-shot: 0.85, 0.81, 0.89\"\n      - \"Table: Baselines on OpenHands | Method | Macro-F1 | Random: 0.50 | Majority: 0.42 | Repeat-3: 0.71 | Cosine-sim: 0.35 | Probe zero-shot: 0.73 | Probe 200-shot: 0.82\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Few-shot learning curve：x轴=fine-tuning样本数（0,50,200,500），y轴=macro-F1，含SWE-agent performance水平虚线\"\n      - \"t-SNE对比：SWE-agent GRU hidden states vs OpenHands GRU hidden states，展示distribution shift但保持cluster结构\"\n    analysis: >\n      Zero-shot F1=0.73证实了跨agent progress信号的可迁移性——probe学到的不仅是SWE-agent特定行为模式。\n      但17.5pp drop也说明domain adaptation是必要的，不能claim\"直接迁移保持有效\"。\n      Few-shot曲线是median档的关键补充实验——200个窗口即可恢复至0.82，说明probe representations\n      提供了strong initialization，远优于from-scratch训练（相同200样本from-scratch仅~0.65）。\n      Claim 3调整为：\"zero-shot迁移存在（+23pp vs random），few-shot adaptation高效（200样本恢复至82%），\n      表明probe学到的progress信号具有跨实现的通用性，但需要少量target-domain数据calibration\"。\n      LF适配问题应在Limitations中明确讨论——command_repetition的format dependency是框架的结构性弱点。\n\n  - name: \"Window Size消融\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-window-size\"\n    description: \"k=3,5,7步窗口大小消融，评估检测粒度与信号积累的tradeoff\"\n    expected_results:\n      k3_macro_f1: 0.86\n      k3_f1_stagnation: 0.81\n      k3_total_windows: 22130\n      k5_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      k5_f1_stagnation: 0.8593\n      k5_total_windows: 15401\n      k7_macro_f1: 0.89\n      k7_f1_stagnation: 0.84\n      k7_total_windows: 11280\n      optimal_k: 5\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=3（0.86）：窗口太短，stagnation信号不够accumulate——3步中可能只有1-2步显示停滞迹象，\n      导致stagnation F1从0.8593降至0.81。同时窗口数量增加（22K vs 15K），但每个窗口的信噪比降低。\n      k=5（0.9055）：最优平衡点——足够长以捕获stagnation onset的时序签名，又不至于被过多context稀释。\n      k=7（0.89）：窗口过长引入两个问题——(1) 跨phase窗口增多（前4步progress+后3步stagnation混合），\n      标签变得ambiguous；(2) 可用训练窗口减少（11K，短轨迹被排除）。\n      k=5 > k=7的1.5pp gap不大，但一致支持5步作为default选择。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Window Size Ablation | k | Windows | Macro-F1 | Stag-F1 | Prog-F1 | 3: 22130, 0.86, 0.81, 0.91 | 5: 15401, 0.9055, 0.8593, 0.9518 | 7: 11280, 0.89, 0.84, 0.94\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line chart: k vs macro-F1和per-class F1，展示k=5的sweet spot\"\n    analysis: >\n      k=5是clear optimal，但k=3和k=7的性能下降不剧烈（<5pp），说明probe对窗口大小较robust。\n      Paper中作为Table放在appendix，主文一句话提及\"k=5 optimal, robust to ±2 steps\"。\n\n  - name: \"架构消融\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-architecture\"\n    description: \"GRU+attention vs GRU+mean-pool vs Transformer encoder vs MLP on concat，在conf≥2上对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      gru_attention_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      gru_meanpool_macro_f1: 0.89\n      transformer_encoder_macro_f1: 0.90\n      mlp_concat_macro_f1: 0.87\n      gru_attention_params: 542000\n      gru_meanpool_params: 530000\n      transformer_encoder_params: 1200000\n      mlp_concat_params: 2600000\n    result_rationale: >\n      GRU+attention（0.9055）vs Transformer（0.90）：差距仅0.5pp，Transformer理论上有更强的长程依赖建模，\n      但5步窗口太短，长程优势无法发挥，反而参数量是GRU的2.2x，更容易在小数据上overfit。\n      GRU+mean-pool（0.89）vs GRU+attention（0.9055）：attention贡献1.5pp，主要来自对stagnation onset位置的加权——\n      attention机制允许模型关注窗口内的关键转折点，mean-pool则均匀对待每步。\n      MLP on concat（0.87）：将5个1024维embedding拼接为5120维向量后接MLP，完全丢弃顺序信息，\n      性能最低但仍远超Repeat-3（+2.7pp），说明embedding空间本身的区分度很高。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Architecture Ablation | Architecture | Macro-F1 | Stag-F1 | Params | Inference ms | GRU+Attn: 0.9055, 0.8593, 542K, 2.8 | GRU+MeanPool: 0.89, 0.84, 530K, 2.5 | Transformer: 0.90, 0.85, 1.2M, 3.5 | MLP-Concat: 0.87, 0.82, 2.6M, 1.2\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Params vs F1 散点图，展示GRU+attention的efficiency优势（最少参数、最高F1）\"\n    analysis: >\n      架构选择对性能的影响（3.5pp range）小于训练数据质量的影响（8.5pp drop on full data）。\n      这支持paper的framing——\"架构是deliberate simple technical choice，不是核心贡献\"。\n      GRU+attention的marginal优势（vs Transformer +0.5pp）在统计上可能不显著，\n      但parameter efficiency（542K vs 1.2M）和inference speed是合理的选择理由。\n      放在appendix，主文用一句话：\"GRU+attention achieves best F1 among four architectures (0.87-0.91 range); architecture choice matters less than label quality.\"\n\n  - name: \"LF Hold-One-Out消融\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-lf-holdout\"\n    description: \"每次移除一个LF重新生成标签并训练probe，量化各LF边际贡献\"\n    expected_results:\n      all_3_lfs_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      without_command_repetition_f1: 0.87\n      without_command_repetition_drop_pp: 3.5\n      without_file_diff_delta_f1: 0.88\n      without_file_diff_delta_drop_pp: 2.5\n      without_outcome_backprop_f1: 0.89\n      without_outcome_backprop_drop_pp: 1.5\n      without_command_repetition_conf2_windows: 9800\n      without_file_diff_delta_conf2_windows: 10200\n      without_outcome_backprop_conf2_windows: 12100\n      without_command_repetition_label_flip_pct: 12.3\n      without_file_diff_delta_label_flip_pct: 8.7\n      without_outcome_backprop_label_flip_pct: 5.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      command_repetition移除后drop最大（-3.5pp）：这是最informative的LF，因为命令重复是stagnation最直接的信号，\n      移除它后12.3%的窗口标签翻转，conf≥2窗口数从15,401降至9,800（大量窗口失去第二个支持LF），\n      训练数据大幅缩减导致probe性能下降。\n      file_diff_delta移除（-2.5pp）：文件改动信号是progress的strong indicator，移除后probe更难区分\n      \"有file diff的progress\"和\"无diff的exploration\"。\n      outcome_backpropagation移除（-1.5pp）：结果回传LF是lagging indicator（需要trajectory结束后才能计算），\n      对实时检测的边际贡献最小。但它提供了唯一的outcome-level信号，移除后probe对\"最终成功前的暂时停滞\"更容易FP。\n      三个LF都有不可替代的贡献（最小drop仍有1.5pp），支持\"三个LF互补\"的框架设计claim。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: LF Hold-One-Out | Removed LF | Macro-F1 | Drop | conf≥2 Windows | Label Flips % | None: 0.9055, -, 15401, - | command_rep: 0.87, -3.5pp, 9800, 12.3% | file_diff: 0.88, -2.5pp, 10200, 8.7% | outcome_bp: 0.89, -1.5pp, 12100, 5.1%\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar chart展示每个LF被移除后的label flip方向（progress→stagnation vs stagnation→progress）\"\n    analysis: >\n      LF hold-out支持框架设计的合理性：每个LF贡献1.5-3.5pp，没有冗余LF。\n      command_repetition是backbone LF，但移除后probe仍达0.87（远超Repeat-3），说明probe不仅学了repetition检测。\n      Paper中作为Table 3放主文（支撑Claim 1），强调LF互补性是data programming在trajectory上有效的关键。\n\n  - name: \"SupCon辅助损失消融\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-supcon\"\n    description: \"对比有/无supervised contrastive loss对F1和embedding分离度的影响\"\n    expected_results:\n      without_supcon_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      with_supcon_macro_f1: 0.915\n      supcon_gain_pp: 1.0\n      without_supcon_silhouette_score: 0.42\n      with_supcon_silhouette_score: 0.58\n      supcon_weight_optimal: 0.3\n      with_supcon_fulldata_macro_f1: 0.835\n      supcon_fulldata_gain_pp: 1.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      当前probe（probe-001）未使用SupCon。添加SupCon辅助损失（权重0.3）在conf≥2上仅提升1pp至0.915——\n      因为conf≥2数据本身已经很clean，embedding空间的CE loss已足够分离两类。\n      但SupCon的真正价值在全量数据上：+1.5pp（0.835 vs 0.82），因为contrastive loss对noisy labels更robust——\n      即使部分样本label错误，大多数同类样本仍会pull together，提供了implicit label smoothing效果。\n      Silhouette score从0.42提升至0.58，说明SupCon确实改善了embedding空间的类别分离度。\n      但整体增益modest（1-1.5pp），在median档下不值得作为独立贡献，放appendix。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: SupCon Ablation | Setting | w/o SupCon | w/ SupCon | Gain | conf≥2 F1: 0.9055, 0.915, +1.0pp | Full F1: 0.82, 0.835, +1.5pp | Silhouette: 0.42, 0.58, +0.16\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"t-SNE visualization对比：无SupCon vs 有SupCon的GRU hidden states，展示类别分离度改善\"\n    analysis: >\n      SupCon提供modest improvement，在全量数据上更有价值（+1.5pp）。\n      建议作为\"confidence-aware training\"的supplement之一——combined with conf-weighted loss，\n      可能将full-data F1推至0.84-0.85。但不改变median档的整体叙事。Appendix material。\n\n  - name: \"Non-NLP Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"non-nlp-baseline\"\n    description: \"仅用纯结构/数值特征分类（行数改动、命令类型、文件数等），证明NL embedding的必要性\"\n    expected_results:\n      structural_features_only_f1: 0.72\n      structural_features_accuracy: 0.78\n      structural_f1_stagnation: 0.63\n      structural_f1_progress: 0.81\n      features_used: 15\n      feature_importance_top3: \"lines_changed_std, unique_commands_ratio, file_count_delta\"\n      gap_vs_probe_pp: 18.5\n      gap_vs_repeat3_pp: -12.3\n      structural_plus_embedding_f1: 0.91\n    result_rationale: >\n      纯结构特征（15个手工特征：行数改动均值/方差、唯一命令比例、文件数变化、命令长度、AST相关指标等）\n      在GBM分类器上达0.72——远超random（0.50）但远低于embedding-based方法（0.9055）。\n      关键gap在stagnation检测（0.63 vs 0.8593）：结构特征无法区分\"表面不同但语义相似的停滞\"——\n      两个不同命令的行数改动可能相似，但语义上一个是有效修复、另一个是无效尝试。\n      NL embedding的增量价值=18.5pp，这是venue fit论证的核心数据——证明NL理解（而非纯SE指标）\n      对progress estimation是必要的，使paper属于NLP scope而非SE-only。\n      Structural+embedding融合（0.91）略优于纯embedding（0.9055），说明结构特征提供少量complementary信号。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: NLP vs Non-NLP Features | Feature Set | Macro-F1 | Stag-F1 | Structural only (15 features): 0.72, 0.63 | NL Embedding only (GRU): 0.9055, 0.8593 | Structural + Embedding: 0.91, 0.87 | Gap (embed-structural): +18.5pp, +23pp\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Feature importance bar chart（结构特征top-10），展示哪些SE指标对progress最有信息量\"\n      - \"Scatter plot：structural feature prediction confidence vs embedding prediction confidence，展示两者disagreement区域\"\n    analysis: >\n      18.5pp gap是venue fit论证的killer evidence——纯结构特征不够，NL understanding是必要的。\n      这将paper锚定在NLP scope：progress estimation不是一个可以用SE metrics解决的问题，需要语义层面的建模。\n      Structural+embedding的marginal gain（+0.5pp）说明feature engineering不是bottleneck。\n      主文Table，用于Section 5的venue fit论证段落。\n\n  - name: \"Data Scaling曲线\"\n    plan_id: \"data-scaling\"\n    description: \"10%/25%/50%/100%训练数据→probe F1，评估标注数据需求和框架效率\"\n    expected_results:\n      scale_10pct_windows: 1540\n      scale_10pct_macro_f1: 0.80\n      scale_25pct_windows: 3850\n      scale_25pct_macro_f1: 0.85\n      scale_50pct_windows: 7700\n      scale_50pct_macro_f1: 0.88\n      scale_100pct_windows: 15401\n      scale_100pct_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      diminishing_returns_threshold: \"50%（~7.7K windows）\"\n      scale_10pct_vs_repeat3_gap_pp: -4.3\n      scale_25pct_vs_repeat3_gap_pp: 0.7\n      scale_50pct_vs_repeat3_gap_pp: 3.7\n    result_rationale: >\n      10%数据（1,540窗口）probe达0.80——低于Repeat-3（0.8432），说明极少数据下heuristic更reliable。\n      25%（3,850窗口）达0.85，首次surpass Repeat-3（+0.7pp），标志着\"probe优于heuristic\"的数据门槛。\n      50%（7,700窗口）达0.88，性能曲线开始flatten——50%→100%仅+2.5pp vs 25%→50%的+3pp。\n      Scaling近似log-linear：每翻倍数据约+2-3pp，符合typical neural model behavior。\n      关键takeaway：框架生成的15K高质量窗口已接近saturation，继续扩大数据量（如纳入conf=1）\n      回报递减且引入噪声——这从数据效率角度论证了\"conf≥2策略的合理性\"。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Data Scaling | Training % | Windows | Macro-F1 | vs Repeat-3 | 10%: 1540, 0.80, -4.3pp | 25%: 3850, 0.85, +0.7pp | 50%: 7700, 0.88, +3.7pp | 100%: 15401, 0.9055, +6.2pp\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Learning curve: x轴=训练窗口数(log scale)，y轴=macro-F1，含Repeat-3水平虚线和25% crossover标注\"\n    analysis: >\n      Data scaling曲线是弱监督框架的效率论证——用LFs自动生成的15K标签足以训练competitive probe。\n      对比人工标注成本：标注15K窗口按$0.5/窗口需$7,500+annotator管理开销，\n      而LF开发是one-time effort（3个LF + majority vote pipeline）。\n      25%crossover point（~4K窗口）是practical guidance——部署时minimum viable dataset约4K窗口。\n      放主文Figure，支撑Claim 1（弱监督框架有效性+数据效率）。\n\n  - name: \"Early Termination模拟\"\n    plan_id: \"early-termination-sim\"\n    description: \"在held-out轨迹上模拟probe-triggered early termination，计算token savings vs success rate tradeoff\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_held_out_trajectories: 320\n      threshold_07_token_savings_pct: 22\n      threshold_07_success_rate_drop_pct: 3.1\n      threshold_05_token_savings_pct: 35\n      threshold_05_success_rate_drop_pct: 7.8\n      threshold_09_token_savings_pct: 12\n      threshold_09_success_rate_drop_pct: 1.2\n      intervention_paradox_cases: 28\n      intervention_paradox_pct: 8.7\n      avg_tokens_saved_per_trajectory: 4200\n      optimal_threshold: 0.7\n      pareto_auc: 0.82\n    result_rationale: >\n      在320条held-out轨迹上模拟：当probe连续N个窗口输出P(stagnation)>threshold时触发early termination。\n      Threshold=0.7（推荐设置）：节省22% tokens（平均每条轨迹省4,200 tokens），success rate仅下降3.1%。\n      下降来自Intervention Paradox：28条轨迹（8.7%）被probe正确识别为\"当前停滞\"后终止，\n      但实际上agent在后续步骤中\"突破\"了停滞并最终解决问题——这是fundamentally不可避免的。\n      Threshold=0.5（激进）：35% token savings但7.8% success rate drop，部分premature termination。\n      Threshold=0.9（保守）：仅12% savings但近零false termination。\n      Median档下这些数据是decent但不spectacular——22% savings不足以支撑standalone的\"cost reduction\"claim，\n      作为supplementary result放附录。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Early Termination Tradeoff | Threshold | Token Savings % | Success Drop % | False Terminations | 0.5: 35%, -7.8%, 25 | 0.7: 22%, -3.1%, 10 | 0.9: 12%, -1.2%, 4\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Pareto curve: x轴=success rate drop，y轴=token savings %，每个threshold一个点，含annotated optimal point\"\n      - \"Case study: 2-3个Intervention Paradox案例——probe正确检测stagnation但agent后来recovered\"\n    analysis: >\n      Early termination实验展示probe的practical deployment价值，但median档下savings不够impressive（22%）。\n      Intervention Paradox（8.7%）是honest limitation——任何real-time monitor都面临这个问题。\n      Paper建议放Discussion section作为\"deployment考量\"，不作为core result。\n      重点highlight Intervention Paradox作为methodological insight——offline probe evaluation和online intervention之间的gap。\n\n  - name: \"可解释性分析（t-SNE + Attention）\"\n    plan_id: \"interpretability\"\n    description: \"GRU hidden states的t-SNE/UMAP可视化 + attention weight在stagnation onset位置的分析\"\n    expected_results:\n      tsne_cluster_separation: \"partial\"\n      tsne_silhouette_score: 0.42\n      tsne_boundary_overlap_pct: 18\n      attention_stagnation_peak_position: \"step 3-4 (late window)\"\n      attention_progress_distribution: \"relatively uniform\"\n      attention_entropy_stagnation: 1.2\n      attention_entropy_progress: 1.8\n      attention_onset_alignment_with_lf_pct: 68\n    result_rationale: >\n      t-SNE展示两个主cluster（progress和stagnation）但存在18%的boundary overlap——\n      这些overlap窗口主要是conf=2中两个LF分歧较大的borderline cases和exploration-that-looks-like-stagnation。\n      Silhouette score 0.42（moderate）反映了问题本身的ambiguity，不是模型缺陷。\n      Attention分析揭示关键模式：stagnation窗口中attention集中在step 3-4（窗口后段），\n      这与stagnation onset的直觉一致——前几步可能还在progress，后几步才开始stagnation。\n      Progress窗口的attention更均匀（entropy 1.8 vs stagnation的1.2），因为每步都有contribution。\n      Attention peak与LF firing位置对齐68%——probe的attention\"看到了\"和LF相似但不完全相同的位置。\n      剩余32%的misalignment是probe学到的LF之外的信号。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"t-SNE 2D scatter plot：progress（蓝）vs stagnation（红），transparency=confidence level，标注overlap region\"\n      - \"Attention heatmap grid：5个典型stagnation窗口和5个progress窗口的attention weight分布，x轴=step position\"\n      - \"Attention entropy histogram：stagnation窗口（左偏，集中attention）vs progress窗口（右偏，分散attention）\"\n    analysis: >\n      可解释性分析是median档下支撑Claim 2（时序建模价值）的关键定性证据。\n      Attention模式提供了GRU vs mean-pool差距（4.5pp）的直观解释：mean-pool等权对待5步，\n      但stagnation detection需要关注\"从哪步开始停滞\"——attention机制正好捕获了这个onset位置信号。\n      t-SNE figure放主文（Figure 3），attention heatmap放主文（Figure 4）。\n      这些可视化弥补了quantitative gap收窄后的说服力需求。\n\n  - name: \"人工标注Gold Set\"\n    plan_id: \"human-annotation\"\n    description: \"400窗口×3标注者人工标注，Fleiss κ，在gold标签上重评所有方法\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_windows_annotated: 400\n      annotators: 3\n      fleiss_kappa: 0.62\n      inter_annotator_agreement_pct: 78\n      majority_vote_label_accuracy_on_gold: 75\n      conf1_label_accuracy_on_gold: 62\n      conf2_label_accuracy_on_gold: 83\n      conf3_label_accuracy_on_gold: 94\n      probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.77\n      probe_gold_f1_stagnation: 0.71\n      probe_gold_f1_progress: 0.83\n      repeat3_gold_macro_f1: 0.72\n      lf_oracle_gold_macro_f1: 0.75\n      meanpool_lr_gold_macro_f1: 0.74\n      llm_judge_gold_macro_f1: 0.82\n      cosine_sim_gold_macro_f1: 0.38\n      gold_progress_pct: 62\n      gold_stagnation_pct: 38\n      gold_vs_auto_label_disagreement_pct: 25\n    result_rationale: >\n      Fleiss κ=0.62（substantial agreement）反映任务的inherent ambiguity——\"progress\"和\"stagnation\"的边界在人类判断中也不清晰，\n      特别是exploration、backtracking、partial progress等灰色地带。\n      Majority vote标签准确率75%（整体），conf分层明显：conf3=94%（几乎完美）、conf2=83%（可靠）、conf1=62%（接近随机）。\n      这直接验证了conf作为质量proxy的有效性，也解释了全量数据F1下降——38%的conf=1标签是错的。\n      Probe在gold上达0.77——低于auto-labeled conf≥2上的0.9055（-13pp），因为：\n      (1) probe在auto-labels上训练，对auto-labels overfitting；(2) human gold发现了一些LFs系统性遗漏的模式\n      （如\"有效exploration被LF标为stagnation\"）。\n      LLM judge在gold上达0.82（超过probe 5pp），因为LLM直接理解语义，不受LF bias的间接影响。\n      关键：probe在gold上仍优于LF oracle（+2pp）和Repeat-3（+5pp），confirm了learning的增量价值。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: All Methods on Human Gold Set (N=400) | Method | Gold Macro-F1 | Gold Stag-F1 | Gold Prog-F1 | LLM Judge (FS): 0.82, 0.78, 0.86 | Probe (conf≥2): 0.77, 0.71, 0.83 | LF Oracle: 0.75, 0.70, 0.80 | MeanPool+LR: 0.74, 0.68, 0.80 | Repeat-3: 0.72, 0.65, 0.79 | Cosine-sim: 0.38, 0.30, 0.46 | Random: 0.50, 0.48, 0.52\"\n      - \"Table: Label Quality by Confidence | Confidence | Windows | Auto-Gold Agreement | Accuracy | conf=1: 160, 62%, 62% | conf=2: 200, 83%, 83% | conf=3: 40, 94%, 94% | Overall: 400, 75%, 75%\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart：所有方法在gold F1上的对比，从高到低排列\"\n      - \"Calibration plot：confidence level vs label accuracy，展示conf的quality proxy有效性\"\n    analysis: >\n      Human gold evaluation是median档的核心实验——它打破circular evaluation，提供\"ground truth\"参考。\n      关键发现：(1) probe在gold上仍是best non-LLM method（0.77），验证了学习的增量价值；\n      (2) LLM judge在gold上领先（0.82），但cost 35x——probe是cost-constrained场景的最佳选择；\n      (3) conf=1标签质量差（62%）是全量数据F1下降的root cause，明确了框架的改进方向（更好的LF或label model）；\n      (4) κ=0.62说明任务本身hard，0.77的gold F1实际上已经接近人类水平。\n      Paper主文Table（最重要的result table之一），Section 5.3 \"Evaluation on Human Gold Labels\"。\n\n  - name: \"LF Temporal Dynamics\"\n    plan_id: \"lf-temporal-dynamics\"\n    description: \"分析各LF在stagnation onset前后的firing时序——leading vs lagging indicator\"\n    expected_results:\n      command_repetition_median_lead_steps: 1.5\n      command_repetition_first_fire_pct: 58\n      file_diff_delta_median_lead_steps: 0.5\n      file_diff_delta_first_fire_pct: 28\n      outcome_backprop_median_lag_steps: 2.0\n      outcome_backprop_first_fire_pct: 14\n      lf_agreement_at_onset: 0.35\n      lf_agreement_deep_stagnation: 0.72\n      probe_attention_aligns_with_leading_lf_pct: 65\n    result_rationale: >\n      command_repetition是最早的leading indicator（median lead 1.5步）：命令重复往往在stagnation初期就出现，\n      agent开始\"重试\"之前的操作。58%的stagnation窗口中它最先firing。\n      file_diff_delta接近同步（lead 0.5步）：文件改动减少与stagnation几乎同时发生，因为停滞的直接表现就是代码不再变化。\n      outcome_backpropagation是lagging indicator（lag 2步）：需要知道轨迹最终结果才能回传，\n      在real-time场景中这个信号不可用——但对offline analysis有价值。\n      Onset时刻LF agreement仅0.35——stagnation初期信号微弱，各LF判断不一致；\n      深度停滞阶段agreement升至0.72——所有信号converge。\n      这解释了conf=1窗口的噪声来源：很多conf=1窗口是stagnation onset的early stage，\n      只有一个leading LF发出信号，其他LF尚未fire。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: LF Temporal Characteristics | LF | Median Lead/Lag | First-Fire % | Type | command_rep: +1.5 steps, 58%, leading | file_diff: +0.5 steps, 28%, synchronous | outcome_bp: -2.0 steps, 14%, lagging\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Timeline plot：以stagnation onset为零点，展示三个LF的firing概率随时间变化的曲线\"\n      - \"Heatmap：LF agreement × window position，展示onset处的低agreement到深度停滞处的高agreement\"\n    analysis: >\n      LF temporal dynamics提供了框架的mechanistic insight——不同LF在stagnation lifecycle中扮演不同角色。\n      对实际部署有指导意义：real-time monitoring应更权重command_repetition（leading），offline analysis可用outcome_backprop（lagging）。\n      对conf=1噪声的解释很有价值——onset阶段的低agreement是structural而非random noise，\n      这为confidence-aware training的改进方向提供了理论依据（时序权重而非静态confidence权重）。\n      放Discussion section或Appendix作为框架的deeper analysis。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"ea9dc2cd-3d17-4be6-9bd9-cd17a4f97e5b","total_cost_usd":0.7054307499999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10641,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":25091,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10641,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":25091,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10641,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10641},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":5609,"outputTokens":22,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.005719,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":25091,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":10641,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.6997117499999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"8a472a74-902f-44b1-adc5-d559d01d823f"}
